(917366, 105272, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of the composition as well as the tone in this image.  You managed to make the water look how I like it to look (something I can never do).  It''s great to see something with emotion and life in this challenge.  Makes me feel like taking a plunge myself.  10</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of the composition as well as the tone in this image.  You managed to make the water look how I like it to look (something I can never do).  It''s great to see something with emotion and life in this challenge.  Makes me feel like taking a plunge myself.  10', '2004-09-20 01:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(917370, 106347, 22975, '<td valign="top">GREAT IDEA!!!!  I had forgotten about this game... how funny.</td>', 'GREAT IDEA!!!!  I had forgotten about this game... how funny.', '2004-09-20 01:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(917371, 106340, 7969, '<td valign="top">LOL I love pig races!!</td>', 'LOL I love pig races!!', '2004-09-20 01:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(917373, 106340, 6008, '<td valign="top">Having spent the past week or so watching pig racing at the local state fair I have to say this is a very apt shot! Great angle on it, really makes the viewer feel like they are there, or even better, in the race. The stop action is good too with the kick up of the hay. If I had any gripe it''s that it seems just a tad dark. Fun shot!</td>', 'Having spent the past week or so watching pig racing at the local state fair I have to say this is a very apt shot! Great angle on it, really makes the viewer feel like they are there, or even better, in the race. The stop action is good too with the kick up of the hay. If I had any gripe it''s that it seems just a tad dark. Fun shot!', '2004-09-20 01:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(917376, 105646, 16301, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge, Great capture! Definitely a 10...</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge, Great capture! Definitely a 10...', '2004-09-20 01:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(917384, 106232, 17304, '<td valign="top">trying cropping a bit of the area behind the buggy to pull it out of the center.</td>', 'trying cropping a bit of the area behind the buggy to pull it out of the center.', '2004-09-20 01:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(917385, 106055, 20210, '<td valign="top">timing done with an audio trigger perhaps? either that, or a damn lot of bulbs!  great shot.  impressive, technical, and aesthetic.  congrats.</td>', 'timing done with an audio trigger perhaps? either that, or a damn lot of bulbs!  great shot.  impressive, technical, and aesthetic.  congrats.', '2004-09-20 01:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
