(917515, 106326, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very sensuous.   The shadows of the drops are quite disconcertening though ... like they are moles or freckles.</td>', 'Very sensuous.   The shadows of the drops are quite disconcertening though ... like they are moles or freckles.', '2004-09-20 03:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
