(917520, 106353, 4226, '<td valign="top">nothing clear in this photograph... no contrast at all.. well I know you tried to take the drop from above rather the usual side view, but this doesn''t help the shot</td>', 'nothing clear in this photograph... no contrast at all.. well I know you tried to take the drop from above rather the usual side view, but this doesn''t help the shot', '2004-09-20 03:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
