(917523, 106199, 4226, '<td valign="top">to much noise, hazy.. what ISO speed were you taking these shots at ? try lower ISO and larger aperture.. larger aperture for shallow depth of field and faster shutter to capture stop the motion</td>', 'to much noise, hazy.. what ISO speed were you taking these shots at ? try lower ISO and larger aperture.. larger aperture for shallow depth of field and faster shutter to capture stop the motion', '2004-09-20 03:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(917524, 106185, 12962, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you chose to hide the faces of the animal and the rider as both are beautiful.  I would have waited for another gait where two feet of the horse are really off the ground to demonstrate stopped motion more effectively but I get your idea.  A tighter crop would also vastly improve this in my opinion.</td>', 'Not sure why you chose to hide the faces of the animal and the rider as both are beautiful.  I would have waited for another gait where two feet of the horse are really off the ground to demonstrate stopped motion more effectively but I get your idea.  A tighter crop would also vastly improve this in my opinion.', '2004-09-20 03:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(917526, 105936, 12962, '<td valign="top">Clever.  Very well thought of.</td>', 'Clever.  Very well thought of.', '2004-09-20 03:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(917527, 106185, 4226, '<td valign="top">well a decent picture, but I was expecting more action shot and something that needs timing...this doesn''t quiet fit ..the horse jumping a fence could be what I was looking for</td>', 'well a decent picture, but I was expecting more action shot and something that needs timing...this doesn''t quiet fit ..the horse jumping a fence could be what I was looking for', '2004-09-20 03:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(917528, 106233, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very distinctive, like an abstract painting.</td>', 'Very distinctive, like an abstract painting.', '2004-09-20 03:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(917529, 106239, 4226, '<td valign="top">You should try to improve upon the background.. use a plain colored background.. for this shot a plain white or a plain black should  do the job for you.. a black is useful if you don''t wan the shadows, else you might use white as well.. ..also I see some motion blur on the neck and hands</td>', 'You should try to improve upon the background.. use a plain colored background.. for this shot a plain white or a plain black should  do the job for you.. a black is useful if you don''t wan the shadows, else you might use white as well.. ..also I see some motion blur on the neck and hands', '2004-09-20 03:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(917530, 106224, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nicely frozen.  It''s like a diorama.  Cropping is very good too.</td>', 'Nicely frozen.  It''s like a diorama.  Cropping is very good too.', '2004-09-20 03:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
