(917537, 106355, 4226, '<td valign="top">Is this real ? very intersting.. hmmmmmm where did you get these magic kids ? lol<br/>very cool image, the background works very well here .. and the positioning of the two boys is perfect.. what else can I ask for ? a 10</td>', 'Is this real ? very intersting.. hmmmmmm where did you get these magic kids ? lolvery cool image, the background works very well here .. and the positioning of the two boys is perfect.. what else can I ask for ? a 10', '2004-09-20 03:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
