(917544, 105171, 19952, '<td valign="top">My only complaint about this shot is that the lighting is a bit harsh. Other than that, this is a well conceived photo and a great example of freezing motion. Very nice job.</td>', 'My only complaint about this shot is that the lighting is a bit harsh. Other than that, this is a well conceived photo and a great example of freezing motion. Very nice job.', '2004-09-20 03:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(917550, 106230, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture. I wish the subject filled a bit more of the frame, but the photo still came out great. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool capture. I wish the subject filled a bit more of the frame, but the photo still came out great. Nice job.', '2004-09-20 03:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(917553, 106191, 19952, '<td valign="top">Boy, are you crazy throwing your camera like that? ;-) This is a very dramatic shot with an interesting composition that I like a lot. The only thing that''s jarring is that bright blue with horizontal striping through it, which usually indicates a simple gradient fill. Still, the shot came out very nice.</td>', 'Boy, are you crazy throwing your camera like that? ;-) This is a very dramatic shot with an interesting composition that I like a lot. The only thing that''s jarring is that bright blue with horizontal striping through it, which usually indicates a simple gradient fill. Still, the shot came out very nice.', '2004-09-20 03:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(917559, 106009, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great capture and a nice action photo. The shot seems a bit dark, so it might look better a little brighter and with a bit more contrast. Still, it''s a really nice shot.</td>', 'Great capture and a nice action photo. The shot seems a bit dark, so it might look better a little brighter and with a bit more contrast. Still, it''s a really nice shot.', '2004-09-20 03:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(917568, 106342, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great action photo, but it appears to be so over-processed that the bull''s skin looks almost like plastic. I think it''s fine to leave photo''s a bit soft or to sharpen the edges a bit without smoothing out the entire photo. This is such a good capture that I bet your original photo would look great without much processing at all. Very nice photo.</td>', 'This is a great action photo, but it appears to be so over-processed that the bull''s skin looks almost like plastic. I think it''s fine to leave photo''s a bit soft or to sharpen the edges a bit without smoothing out the entire photo. This is such a good capture that I bet your original photo would look great without much processing at all. Very nice photo.', '2004-09-20 03:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(917573, 106017, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. You got a lot of great detail on the duck, but it looks like that resulted in a bit of noise in the background. You could try just sharpening the foreground on shots where the background is supposed to be out of focus. Still, this is a good photo that works great for this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice shot. You got a lot of great detail on the duck, but it looks like that resulted in a bit of noise in the background. You could try just sharpening the foreground on shots where the background is supposed to be out of focus. Still, this is a good photo that works great for this challenge.', '2004-09-20 03:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(917576, 106053, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice, bright photo that works great for this challenge. There''s a bit of a halo around the subject, which could be from overprocessing, but the shot still came out nice. Good job.</td>', 'Nice, bright photo that works great for this challenge. There''s a bit of a halo around the subject, which could be from overprocessing, but the shot still came out nice. Good job.', '2004-09-20 03:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(917581, 105272, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great action capture and the desaturation works well. I think it would have been better to see the subject''s face, but the photo still came out very nice. Good job.</td>', 'This is a great action capture and the desaturation works well. I think it would have been better to see the subject''s face, but the photo still came out very nice. Good job.', '2004-09-20 04:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(917582, 105730, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. This is one of the best shots in this challenge for capturing great detail in a fast action shot. Really nice job.</td>', 'Very nice capture. This is one of the best shots in this challenge for capturing great detail in a fast action shot. Really nice job.', '2004-09-20 04:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(917585, 106055, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a great motion capture. If I''m being picky, I would say that the orientation of this shot looks like it would be better either 90 degrees CCW or upside-down since something seems odd about the hammer standing on its head. But that''s a minor point - this is a really great shot.</td>', 'This is such a great motion capture. If I''m being picky, I would say that the orientation of this shot looks like it would be better either 90 degrees CCW or upside-down since something seems odd about the hammer standing on its head. But that''s a minor point - this is a really great shot.', '2004-09-20 04:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(917587, 106199, 22781, '<td valign="top">Ohhh lots of noise....</td>', 'Ohhh lots of noise....', '2004-09-20 04:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(917589, 106259, 19952, '<td valign="top">Hey, I know those birds! You can always hear them coming. :-) This is a really nice capture with a good background as well. Very good job!</td>', 'Hey, I know those birds! You can always hear them coming. :-) This is a really nice capture with a good background as well. Very good job!', '2004-09-20 04:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(917590, 106256, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, but could use some more focus.</td>', 'Nice catch, but could use some more focus.', '2004-09-20 04:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
