(917647, 105988, 19952, '<td valign="top">This came out really nicely. I think I might prefer a shot of just the ceral falling without the juice since that makes the shot simpler and more dramatic, but the reflection is interesting. Very nice job.</td>', 'This came out really nicely. I think I might prefer a shot of just the ceral falling without the juice since that makes the shot simpler and more dramatic, but the reflection is interesting. Very nice job.', '2004-09-20 05:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(917650, 106287, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting shot with nice dramatic contrast. I really like it a lot and it''s perfect for this challenge. Very good job.</td>', 'This is a really interesting shot with nice dramatic contrast. I really like it a lot and it''s perfect for this challenge. Very good job.', '2004-09-20 05:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(917654, 106205, 19952, '<td valign="top">These shots tend to do well and with very good reason. This is an excellent motion capture of a dramatic subject with bright colors and a simple background. My only nitpick would be to move the subject up slightly, but it still looks great like this. Very nice job.</td>', 'These shots tend to do well and with very good reason. This is an excellent motion capture of a dramatic subject with bright colors and a simple background. My only nitpick would be to move the subject up slightly, but it still looks great like this. Very nice job.', '2004-09-20 05:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(917658, 106293, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture. The background is nice and simple, but my only complaint is that there isn''t enough detail on the subject. Maybe you can select just the birds and brighten/sharpen them a bit. Still, a very nice shot and perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Very cool capture. The background is nice and simple, but my only complaint is that there isn''t enough detail on the subject. Maybe you can select just the birds and brighten/sharpen them a bit. Still, a very nice shot and perfect for this challenge.', '2004-09-20 05:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(917663, 106207, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a nice motion capture that I could seriously see in an ad for Coors Light. Excellent color and lighting and a nice simple background. Really great job.</td>', 'This is a nice motion capture that I could seriously see in an ad for Coors Light. Excellent color and lighting and a nice simple background. Really great job.', '2004-09-20 05:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(917665, 106340, 19952, '<td valign="top">You must be crazy to put your camera on the ground in front of a charging pig. ;-) But it worked out well since the shot is realy nice and the angle is excellent.It would look better with a bit more light, but it still came out really well - good job.</td>', 'You must be crazy to put your camera on the ground in front of a charging pig. ;-) But it worked out well since the shot is realy nice and the angle is excellent.It would look better with a bit more light, but it still came out really well - good job.', '2004-09-20 05:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(917669, 106244, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great colors and an excellent motion capture. This is a really nice shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Great colors and an excellent motion capture. This is a really nice shot for this challenge.', '2004-09-20 05:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(917672, 106348, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot and a great motion capture. I like the nice, simple silhouette and the composition is excellent. Really great job.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot and a great motion capture. I like the nice, simple silhouette and the composition is excellent. Really great job.', '2004-09-20 05:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(917674, 106355, 21714, '<td valign="top">Excellent work. Phenomenal execution.  Looks like a scene from a Hong Kong action movie or a scene from the Matrix. You deserve a big 10 for this. My favourite for Blue.</td>', 'Excellent work. Phenomenal execution.  Looks like a scene from a Hong Kong action movie or a scene from the Matrix. You deserve a big 10 for this. My favourite for Blue.', '2004-09-20 05:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(917678, 106362, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot and a great motion capture. I think it would be nice if there were actually people on this ride and if you got a closer shot so that we could see more detail, but it still came out really nice like this. Good job.</td>', 'Really nice shot and a great motion capture. I think it would be nice if there were actually people on this ride and if you got a closer shot so that we could see more detail, but it still came out really nice like this. Good job.', '2004-09-20 05:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(917679, 105653, 21714, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, execution and the control of lighting.  Not sure about the choice of pieces you have used, like 2 kings and the rest still flying out of the board. Still, a great shot and you deserve a 10.</td>', 'Love the idea, execution and the control of lighting.  Not sure about the choice of pieces you have used, like 2 kings and the rest still flying out of the board. Still, a great shot and you deserve a 10.', '2004-09-20 05:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(917681, 106194, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I could almost hear the chopper. I also like the way the bird is angled on the other side. Love this one.</td>', 'Great shot. I could almost hear the chopper. I also like the way the bird is angled on the other side. Love this one.', '2004-09-20 05:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(917684, 106136, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cool motion capture. The three things that I think would improve this shot the most would be to move the hurdles away from the trees to avoid those dark shadows, to adjust your white balance or exposure so the white bars aren''t quite so glaring, and to rotate the shot slightly so that the bars are horizontal. Still, this is a really cute shot and excellent for this challenge.</td>', 'Very cool motion capture. The three things that I think would improve this shot the most would be to move the hurdles away from the trees to avoid those dark shadows, to adjust your white balance or exposure so the white bars aren''t quite so glaring, and to rotate the shot slightly so that the bars are horizontal. Still, this is a really cute shot and excellent for this challenge.', '2004-09-20 05:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(917689, 105708, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and think the focus on the eyes is excellent. For this particular challenge, I think it would be better if the object in motion were also in focus, but that would have been hard for this shot and I like the overall image the way you shot it. Very nice job.</td>', 'I really like this shot and think the focus on the eyes is excellent. For this particular challenge, I think it would be better if the object in motion were also in focus, but that would have been hard for this shot and I like the overall image the way you shot it. Very nice job.', '2004-09-20 05:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(917693, 106370, 16075, '<td valign="top">I think it is amazing how you managed to stop the action on Car #7 so there is absolutely no blurr at all...kudos.</td>', 'I think it is amazing how you managed to stop the action on Car #7 so there is absolutely no blurr at all...kudos.', '2004-09-20 05:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(917698, 105871, 19982, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if it was ever in motion ... might be a parked car.  In my voting, I''m looking more for obvious images of action which have been frozen by the camera.</td>', 'Can''t tell if it was ever in motion ... might be a parked car.  In my voting, I''m looking more for obvious images of action which have been frozen by the camera.', '2004-09-20 06:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(917699, 106285, 19982, '<td valign="top">My only complaint here would be that hot air balloons move so slowly that there isn''t a lot of ''action'' to be stopped...  otherwise, I love this image!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'My only complaint here would be that hot air balloons move so slowly that there isn''t a lot of ''action'' to be stopped...  otherwise, I love this image!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-20 06:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
