(917722, 105836, 24459, '<td valign="top">Some will probably say it''s a bit fuzzy, but I love the shot, and the simple composition. Very nice</td>', 'Some will probably say it''s a bit fuzzy, but I love the shot, and the simple composition. Very nice', '2004-09-20 06:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(917723, 105848, 24459, '<td valign="top">A nice and clear picture. I would suggest working a bit on the composition. The bird seems to escape from the picture. I like it though. The background is lovely</td>', 'A nice and clear picture. I would suggest working a bit on the composition. The bird seems to escape from the picture. I like it though. The background is lovely', '2004-09-20 06:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
