(917755, 106259, 24459, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot. However I think choosing a few and cropping the pic nicely would make it even better. But that''s just a thought</td>', 'I really like the shot. However I think choosing a few and cropping the pic nicely would make it even better. But that''s just a thought', '2004-09-20 07:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
