(917757, 105631, 17503, '<td valign="top">Nicely timed, but pay attention to DOF and focus, the water looks a bit "soft". Then agan it could just be the compression used in the small on-screen image.....</td>', 'Nicely timed, but pay attention to DOF and focus, the water looks a bit "soft". Then agan it could just be the compression used in the small on-screen image.....', '2004-09-20 07:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
