(918065, 106103, 509, '<td valign="top">The colors look fairly off here, as if the white balance is incorrect.  Changing that and maybe adding some contrast would improve this imho.</td>', 'The colors look fairly off here, as if the white balance is incorrect.  Changing that and maybe adding some contrast would improve this imho.', '2004-09-20 11:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(918067, 106285, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here.  Shame that there weren''t any clouds in the sky to give more depth and texture to the background.</td>', 'I like the composition here.  Shame that there weren''t any clouds in the sky to give more depth and texture to the background.', '2004-09-20 11:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(918068, 105716, 509, '<td valign="top">The slight twinge of smoke is a nice touch.  I''m not sure about the crop however.  Maybe a little tighter on the bottom, or having the person''s left hand out of the shot.</td>', 'The slight twinge of smoke is a nice touch.  I''m not sure about the crop however.  Maybe a little tighter on the bottom, or having the person''s left hand out of the shot.', '2004-09-20 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(918070, 106123, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  Showing the feather that small though, really leaves me wanting to see more detail.  I agree with the use of negative space, but here it overpowers the subject.  A closer zoom on the feather (and a higher shutter speed if necessary) might improve this imho.</td>', 'I like the idea.  Showing the feather that small though, really leaves me wanting to see more detail.  I agree with the use of negative space, but here it overpowers the subject.  A closer zoom on the feather (and a higher shutter speed if necessary) might improve this imho.', '2004-09-20 11:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(918073, 106179, 509, '<td valign="top">If the plane is taking off or landing, I would have tried to get it a little closer to the ground.  Some kind of ground reference (i.e. framing the plane with a nearby tree branch or the like), would help establish depth and give a little more color to the shot.  The sky is fairly drab while the plane doesn''t show a lot of contrast.  Perhaps if the plane filled the frame from wing tip to wing tip (if your camera''s resolution would allow for that) would make this more appealing.</td>', 'If the plane is taking off or landing, I would have tried to get it a little closer to the ground.  Some kind of ground reference (i.e. framing the plane with a nearby tree branch or the like), would help establish depth and give a little more color to the shot.  The sky is fairly drab while the plane doesn''t show a lot of contrast.  Perhaps if the plane filled the frame from wing tip to wing tip (if your camera''s resolution would allow for that) would make this more appealing.', '2004-09-20 11:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(918075, 105936, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I think a monotone background would give this more of a studio feel.  Could be a good candidate for white-on-white imho.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I think a monotone background would give this more of a studio feel.  Could be a good candidate for white-on-white imho.', '2004-09-20 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(918077, 106136, 509, '<td valign="top">A good subject.  I think this shot could be improved by rotating the image about 1-2 degrees CW and cropping so that the pipes frame the shot side to side and top to bottom</td>', 'A good subject.  I think this shot could be improved by rotating the image about 1-2 degrees CW and cropping so that the pipes frame the shot side to side and top to bottom', '2004-09-20 11:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(918079, 105653, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The lighting, composition and motion are all captured well.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The lighting, composition and motion are all captured well.', '2004-09-20 11:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(918081, 105499, 509, '<td valign="top">Technically there isn''t supposed to be any motion blur.  I don''t agree with that stipulation of the challenge details, but regardless, thats one of the requirements.  A nice pan shot nonetheless</td>', 'Technically there isn''t supposed to be any motion blur.  I don''t agree with that stipulation of the challenge details, but regardless, thats one of the requirements.  A nice pan shot nonetheless', '2004-09-20 11:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(918085, 106347, 509, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Good use of primary colors and framing.  I think a deeper depth of field would work here though, as it is difficult to pick out a single in-focus yellow piece to lock onto.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Good use of primary colors and framing.  I think a deeper depth of field would work here though, as it is difficult to pick out a single in-focus yellow piece to lock onto.', '2004-09-20 12:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
