(918144, 106331, 5822, '<td valign="top">this is a really nice photo. I particularly like the concentric ripples of water around the duck and the odd position of the ducks body. Colors are good too. Two gripes I have with the picture are that I think focus could be better, or higher shutter speed used, and the distracting piece of land in the lower left.  Other than that, I like it.</td>', 'this is a really nice photo. I particularly like the concentric ripples of water around the duck and the odd position of the ducks body. Colors are good too. Two gripes I have with the picture are that I think focus could be better, or higher shutter speed used, and the distracting piece of land in the lower left.  Other than that, I like it.', '2004-09-20 12:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
