(918786, 105936, 22310, '<td valign="top">You captured the motion nicely with enough DOF and light.  It may just be my monitor but it looks a little over shappened for my taste.  Overall nice photo. 6</td>', 'You captured the motion nicely with enough DOF and light.  It may just be my monitor but it looks a little over shappened for my taste.  Overall nice photo. 6', '2004-09-21 00:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
