(918792, 106207, 22310, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and DOF.  The red Coors letters give a nice ballance to the green back ground.</td>', 'I like the lighting and DOF.  The red Coors letters give a nice ballance to the green back ground.', '2004-09-21 00:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
