(918800, 105171, 22310, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, you captured the motion perfectly.  Minor point, but I would have lowered the light on the dart board and blured it by using a wider appature to narrow the DOF.  This would minimize the distracting nature of the board. 6</td>', 'Cool idea, you captured the motion perfectly.  Minor point, but I would have lowered the light on the dart board and blured it by using a wider appature to narrow the DOF.  This would minimize the distracting nature of the board. 6', '2004-09-21 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
