(919043, 105675, 24128, '<td valign="top">It''s ''shot'' not ''shooted'', and that''s the only thing that I can find wrong :)<br/>Very well done, excellent capture</td>', 'It''s ''shot'' not ''shooted'', and that''s the only thing that I can find wrong :)Very well done, excellent capture', '2004-09-21 05:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(919044, 106194, 23300, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I personally feel that the people in the image detract from the impact though.</td>', 'Awesome. I personally feel that the people in the image detract from the impact though.', '2004-09-21 05:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(919046, 106347, 24128, '<td valign="top">A childhood memory and an excellent photo in one, ahhh bliss :)</td>', 'A childhood memory and an excellent photo in one, ahhh bliss :)', '2004-09-21 05:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(919047, 106017, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image has a really quirky feel which works really well. The cropping is powerful also.</td>', 'This image has a really quirky feel which works really well. The cropping is powerful also.', '2004-09-21 05:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(919048, 106051, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition is really powerful. The spread of colours and tones really enhance the impact of this image.</td>', 'The composition is really powerful. The spread of colours and tones really enhance the impact of this image.', '2004-09-21 06:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(919050, 106097, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful image. The composition works well and the lighting and exposure are excellent.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful image. The composition works well and the lighting and exposure are excellent.', '2004-09-21 06:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(919051, 106154, 24128, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice pic, but the motion blur really does go against the challenge. I have no idea what camera you are using but if it''s a case that you have no control of the shutter speed then you could try adding lots more light, or try presetting the camera focus and exposure to the bright light from the windows in the background and then take a few steps back before capturing the movement. Any underexposure could then be addressed afterwards.</td>', 'It''s a nice pic, but the motion blur really does go against the challenge. I have no idea what camera you are using but if it''s a case that you have no control of the shutter speed then you could try adding lots more light, or try presetting the camera focus and exposure to the bright light from the windows in the background and then take a few steps back before capturing the movement. Any underexposure could then be addressed afterwards.', '2004-09-21 06:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(919052, 106096, 23300, '<td valign="top">The cropping works well. I also love the rich colours and tones.</td>', 'The cropping works well. I also love the rich colours and tones.', '2004-09-21 06:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(919055, 106239, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition works well. The flash lighting is a bit harsh as the highlights are very bright and the shadow on the wall detracts from the impact of the image.</td>', 'The composition works well. The flash lighting is a bit harsh as the highlights are very bright and the shadow on the wall detracts from the impact of the image.', '2004-09-21 06:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(919056, 106009, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition works really well.</td>', 'The composition works really well.', '2004-09-21 06:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(919057, 106199, 24128, '<td valign="top">The quality of this pic is questionable, it looks as though your image was too dark and you have adjusted the brightness and contrast. It would have helped a lot of you would have also adjusted the levels (increased the shadows) to compensate.</td>', 'The quality of this pic is questionable, it looks as though your image was too dark and you have adjusted the brightness and contrast. It would have helped a lot of you would have also adjusted the levels (increased the shadows) to compensate.', '2004-09-21 06:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(919060, 106357, 23300, '<td valign="top">The rich colours are beautiful. The compostion works well. I wonder if the main subject was a little more to the right if it would add just a little more energy to the image. I think you have really captured and expressed the emotion of the scene.</td>', 'The rich colours are beautiful. The compostion works well. I wonder if the main subject was a little more to the right if it would add just a little more energy to the image. I think you have really captured and expressed the emotion of the scene.', '2004-09-21 06:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(919061, 106336, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the rich colours and tones are beautiful. The compostion presents the subject well also. It is a little hard to make out the details of the image. Good Luck.</td>', 'I think the rich colours and tones are beautiful. The compostion presents the subject well also. It is a little hard to make out the details of the image. Good Luck.', '2004-09-21 06:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(919062, 106010, 23300, '<td valign="top">The rich colours and composition really enhance the impact of the image.</td>', 'The rich colours and composition really enhance the impact of the image.', '2004-09-21 06:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(919064, 106348, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The exposure and composition stand out the most to me. The depth of field is also perfect for this scene.</td>', 'Beautiful. The exposure and composition stand out the most to me. The depth of field is also perfect for this scene.', '2004-09-21 06:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(919065, 105848, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful image. The soft tones of the background really enhance the subject. The composition really adds to the sense of motion and freedom.</td>', 'This is a powerful image. The soft tones of the background really enhance the subject. The composition really adds to the sense of motion and freedom.', '2004-09-21 06:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(919066, 106331, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The bright colours and perfect exposure make this a powerful image.</td>', 'Great composition. The bright colours and perfect exposure make this a powerful image.', '2004-09-21 06:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(919067, 106238, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great title. Of course I start seeing faces in there.</td>', 'Great title. Of course I start seeing faces in there.', '2004-09-21 06:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(919069, 106287, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the dark tones and high contrast of this image almost make it abstract. To me its a very evocative image. The glare in the dark areas and the white foam across the middle express a dark and moody sense while at the same time being powerful and merciless. The only thing I would change would be to rotate a little to straighten the horizon. Just personal taste. Good Luck.</td>', 'I think the dark tones and high contrast of this image almost make it abstract. To me its a very evocative image. The glare in the dark areas and the white foam across the middle express a dark and moody sense while at the same time being powerful and merciless. The only thing I would change would be to rotate a little to straighten the horizon. Just personal taste. Good Luck.', '2004-09-21 06:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(919080, 106309, 16301, '<td valign="top">This has to be Manny''s photo, who else takes great photos in Asia on this site?<br/> <br/>Excellent work! (9) Good luck...</td>', 'This has to be Manny''s photo, who else takes great photos in Asia on this site? Excellent work! (9) Good luck...', '2004-09-21 06:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(919083, 105716, 23300, '<td valign="top">The muted lighting adds to the dynamics of the shot. Great composition too.</td>', 'The muted lighting adds to the dynamics of the shot. Great composition too.', '2004-09-21 07:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(919086, 105272, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The tones and black and white add to the energy of the image. It creates a sense of the vastness of the ocean.</td>', 'Great composition. The tones and black and white add to the energy of the image. It creates a sense of the vastness of the ocean.', '2004-09-21 07:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
