(919101, 106164, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a really evocative image. The black and white works well. I think the contrasting textures work well together. And the composition enhances the sense of action.</td>', 'This is a really evocative image. The black and white works well. I think the contrasting textures work well together. And the composition enhances the sense of action.', '2004-09-21 07:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(919111, 106314, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image appeals to me the more I look at it. The expression on the subject''s face contrasted against the brickwork is quite interesting. I wonder if making it black and white would enhance the textures and give the image a bit more emotional impact. Cropping it a little tighter around the subject might also enhance the impact.</td>', 'This image appeals to me the more I look at it. The expression on the subject''s face contrasted against the brickwork is quite interesting. I wonder if making it black and white would enhance the textures and give the image a bit more emotional impact. Cropping it a little tighter around the subject might also enhance the impact.', '2004-09-21 07:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(919114, 105307, 15920, '<td valign="top">Two things that I think might hurt you here: this is very slow motion and selective desat might be a little overdone lately.  However, for me, both are working very well.  This is a unique image that is well done in this challenge, and it really stands out in my mind.  Very nice, with perfect DOF and just a few very bright highlights.</td>', 'Two things that I think might hurt you here: this is very slow motion and selective desat might be a little overdone lately.  However, for me, both are working very well.  This is a unique image that is well done in this challenge, and it really stands out in my mind.  Very nice, with perfect DOF and just a few very bright highlights.', '2004-09-21 07:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
