(919202, 106362, 19710, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning photograph!  The composition is strong, clearly featuring frozen motion, and the light accentuates the contrast of the strong colors against the vivid background of the sky.  There is some loss of detail in the shadows/washout of highlights, but certainly not enough to detract from an exceptional photograph.  Congratualtions on a job well done!</td>', 'This is a stunning photograph!  The composition is strong, clearly featuring frozen motion, and the light accentuates the contrast of the strong colors against the vivid background of the sky.  There is some loss of detail in the shadows/washout of highlights, but certainly not enough to detract from an exceptional photograph.  Congratualtions on a job well done!', '2004-09-21 09:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
