(919367, 105653, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is realy cool and emotive image.  Would like to know how you did this but in any case this is a very good image.</td>', 'This is realy cool and emotive image.  Would like to know how you did this but in any case this is a very good image.', '2004-09-21 12:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(919368, 105716, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good timing to get this. Wonder how many tries. Small amount of motion blur on the slide and less on the cartridge. The smoke adds to the catch as well.</td>', 'Good timing to get this. Wonder how many tries. Small amount of motion blur on the slide and less on the cartridge. The smoke adds to the catch as well.', '2004-09-21 12:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(919371, 106314, 13136, '<td valign="top">A bit much motion blur on the ball for a "Stop Motion" challenge. I like the subject and how you caught the child''s emotion.</td>', 'A bit much motion blur on the ball for a "Stop Motion" challenge. I like the subject and how you caught the child''s emotion.', '2004-09-21 12:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(919373, 105469, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good capture and the position of the model is great.  Think it would have need a litle better exposure and the face of the model dont seem perfectly focused.</td>', 'Good capture and the position of the model is great.  Think it would have need a litle better exposure and the face of the model dont seem perfectly focused.', '2004-09-21 12:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(919375, 106361, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good stop. Not sure I like cropping the top of his head out, but good color and lighting.</td>', 'Good stop. Not sure I like cropping the top of his head out, but good color and lighting.', '2004-09-21 12:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(919378, 106164, 12443, '<td valign="top">I like this one and the black and white effect I think adds to it a real nice photo (9)</td>', 'I like this one and the black and white effect I think adds to it a real nice photo (9)', '2004-09-21 12:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(919379, 106187, 15919, '<td valign="top">Great image though I´m not sure how good it is for the challenge.  But in any case the colors composition, focus and sharpness are all very good.</td>', 'Great image though I´m not sure how good it is for the challenge.  But in any case the colors composition, focus and sharpness are all very good.', '2004-09-21 12:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(919380, 106351, 26847, '<td valign="top">Nice light.  Excellent center zone focus.  However, your background is incredibly distracting.  Also, this shot would be stronger if the foreground was in sharp focus since the action is coming towards the foreground.</td>', 'Nice light.  Excellent center zone focus.  However, your background is incredibly distracting.  Also, this shot would be stronger if the foreground was in sharp focus since the action is coming towards the foreground.', '2004-09-21 12:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(919381, 106322, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good stop action. I might have cropped so the larger space was on the left instead of the right. Good color and lighting. I like the well defined shadow on the grass as well.</td>', 'Good stop action. I might have cropped so the larger space was on the left instead of the right. Good color and lighting. I like the well defined shadow on the grass as well.', '2004-09-21 12:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(919383, 106207, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Looks like an advertisement.  Would have needed a litle brighter exposure but in any case this is a good image.</td>', 'Nice image.  Looks like an advertisement.  Would have needed a litle brighter exposure but in any case this is a good image.', '2004-09-21 12:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(919384, 105855, 25483, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I seriously think you have made a mistake by choosing this subject.  The previous winner (Stopped Motion 1) was a shot of a flying seagull, and if any members are aware of this fact I think they will make it down for obvious reasons.</td>', 'Great shot but I seriously think you have made a mistake by choosing this subject.  The previous winner (Stopped Motion 1) was a shot of a flying seagull, and if any members are aware of this fact I think they will make it down for obvious reasons.', '2004-09-21 12:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(919385, 106314, 26847, '<td valign="top">Too much motion blur on ball.  Subject matter is confusing.  Composition is muddled.  Lighting is far too neutral.  Overall focus is professional.</td>', 'Too much motion blur on ball.  Subject matter is confusing.  Composition is muddled.  Lighting is far too neutral.  Overall focus is professional.', '2004-09-21 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(919386, 105675, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is strange, cool and original.</td>', 'This is strange, cool and original.', '2004-09-21 12:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(919389, 106347, 13136, '<td valign="top">Clever and different idea. Reminds me of Die Hard 2 with the from-above shot of Bruce Willis ejecting from the exploding plane. Didn''t you have any C-4 to use on the game? Good colorand lighting. Perfect use of DOF as well.</td>', 'Clever and different idea. Reminds me of Die Hard 2 with the from-above shot of Bruce Willis ejecting from the exploding plane. Didn''t you have any C-4 to use on the game? Good colorand lighting. Perfect use of DOF as well.', '2004-09-21 12:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(919391, 106159, 15919, '<td valign="top">Stoping motion for sure.  But my opinion is that the colors are dull, the image is unsharp, background isn´t very nice and you should have given it a thighter cropin.</td>', 'Stoping motion for sure.  But my opinion is that the colors are dull, the image is unsharp, background isn´t very nice and you should have given it a thighter cropin.', '2004-09-21 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(919392, 106354, 26847, '<td valign="top">Thisis a rather tame moment for a windsurfer.  The lack of drama severely undermines the purpose of the photograph.  This doesn''t feel like stopped motion. It simply feels like the wrong moment caught on film.  The contrast on the water is quite nice, however.</td>', 'Thisis a rather tame moment for a windsurfer.  The lack of drama severely undermines the purpose of the photograph.  This doesn''t feel like stopped motion. It simply feels like the wrong moment caught on film.  The contrast on the water is quite nice, however.', '2004-09-21 12:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(919394, 106326, 26847, '<td valign="top">Strange subject matter, but the sharpness, focus and contrast is great!</td>', 'Strange subject matter, but the sharpness, focus and contrast is great!', '2004-09-21 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(919396, 106256, 25483, '<td valign="top">If the butterfly were just a bit more in focus and a little more closer this would have been a 9 or 10.<br/>I do realize how tough this one is to get so I will give you a 7.  At least your trying to be original and creative and not trying to copy a seagull shot.<br/></td>', 'If the butterfly were just a bit more in focus and a little more closer this would have been a 9 or 10.I do realize how tough this one is to get so I will give you a 7.  At least your trying to be original and creative and not trying to copy a seagull shot.', '2004-09-21 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(919398, 106002, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. I might have darkened it a bit and I wish it were a bit larger, but a great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice catch. I might have darkened it a bit and I wish it were a bit larger, but a great shot nonetheless.', '2004-09-21 12:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(919399, 106252, 26847, '<td valign="top">Excellent stopped motion, but the composition hurts the picture.  The motorcycle is perfectly horizontal.  Even if this how it was in reality, it undermines the drama of the shot.  I''d recompose this at a diagonal, which is effortless to do in Photoshop.  I''d also brighten up the person because the motorcycle is dominating the shot due to the hot reflections off its surface.</td>', 'Excellent stopped motion, but the composition hurts the picture.  The motorcycle is perfectly horizontal.  Even if this how it was in reality, it undermines the drama of the shot.  I''d recompose this at a diagonal, which is effortless to do in Photoshop.  I''d also brighten up the person because the motorcycle is dominating the shot due to the hot reflections off its surface.', '2004-09-21 12:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(919400, 106285, 13136, '<td valign="top">Balloons don''t generally have a whole lotta motion to stop. Does not get a stopped motion idea across. Nice shot of the ballons.</td>', 'Balloons don''t generally have a whole lotta motion to stop. Does not get a stopped motion idea across. Nice shot of the ballons.', '2004-09-21 12:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(919401, 106328, 26847, '<td valign="top">Nice variations in focal planes.  Composition is solid.  Light is too neutral.  Lastly, there is something undramatic about the back of a duck, no matter how beautiful its wings may be.</td>', 'Nice variations in focal planes.  Composition is solid.  Light is too neutral.  Lastly, there is something undramatic about the back of a duck, no matter how beautiful its wings may be.', '2004-09-21 12:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(919402, 105708, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Unfortunately, the DOF choice here leaves the objects that are in motion (arm and ball) out of focus, kinda defeating the idea of "Stop Motion".</td>', 'Nice composition. Unfortunately, the DOF choice here leaves the objects that are in motion (arm and ball) out of focus, kinda defeating the idea of "Stop Motion".', '2004-09-21 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(919403, 106199, 25483, '<td valign="top">Download Neat Image to get rid of the grain<br/>//www.neatimage.com/<br/> <br/>However you will need to work on fixing the problem you have with overexposure.</td>', 'Download Neat Image to get rid of the grain//www.neatimage.com/ However you will need to work on fixing the problem you have with overexposure.', '2004-09-21 12:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(919406, 106188, 26847, '<td valign="top">Great water!  Too bad the human''s posture is so stiff.  Lastly, the overall contrast is far too neutral.  But, the water is wonderful!</td>', 'Great water!  Too bad the human''s posture is so stiff.  Lastly, the overall contrast is far too neutral.  But, the water is wonderful!', '2004-09-21 12:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(919407, 106335, 25483, '<td valign="top">Hey I thought they closed the whirlepool jets ride several weeks ago?  how did you get this shot???</td>', 'Hey I thought they closed the whirlepool jets ride several weeks ago?  how did you get this shot???', '2004-09-21 12:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(919411, 105675, 25483, '<td valign="top">How did you pull this off???<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'How did you pull this off??? 10', '2004-09-21 12:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(919412, 106185, 26847, '<td valign="top">This simply isn''t stopped motion.  Look at the extreme motions that have been stopped in other photos.  This feels like a snapshot.  Sorry to be so direct.</td>', 'This simply isn''t stopped motion.  Look at the extreme motions that have been stopped in other photos.  This feels like a snapshot.  Sorry to be so direct.', '2004-09-21 12:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(919413, 106172, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and DOF choice in this shot. While the selective desaturation emphasises the flying grass (keeping this from looking like a static setup shot), it feels a bit strange to me.</td>', 'I like the composition and DOF choice in this shot. While the selective desaturation emphasises the flying grass (keeping this from looking like a static setup shot), it feels a bit strange to me.', '2004-09-21 12:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(919416, 106191, 26847, '<td valign="top">Puhleeeze....</td>', 'Puhleeeze....', '2004-09-21 12:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(919417, 106207, 26847, '<td valign="top">Nice frozen motion.  However, the composition really hurts the photo.  Consider having the beer can at an angle and don''t crop out the bottom of the can.</td>', 'Nice frozen motion.  However, the composition really hurts the photo.  Consider having the beer can at an angle and don''t crop out the bottom of the can.', '2004-09-21 12:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(919418, 105499, 13136, '<td valign="top">While the car is in focus and shows no motion, the street and background do show motion blur. This means you were moving the same direction and speed as the subject. That kind of diminishes the "motion stop" feel of the shot.  I like the composition and cropping.</td>', 'While the car is in focus and shows no motion, the street and background do show motion blur. This means you were moving the same direction and speed as the subject. That kind of diminishes the "motion stop" feel of the shot.  I like the composition and cropping.', '2004-09-21 12:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(919419, 106125, 26847, '<td valign="top">Composition is extremely weak.  The lighting is flat.  There is no drama in this picture.  It feels more like a snapshot than a well crafted photo.</td>', 'Composition is extremely weak.  The lighting is flat.  There is no drama in this picture.  It feels more like a snapshot than a well crafted photo.', '2004-09-21 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(919423, 106309, 26847, '<td valign="top">What an excellent photo!  Your sense of light and color contrast is wonderful.  The subject matter is engrossing.  However, the composition is weak and the lighting is a bit flat.  Consider cropping off the right edge so the composition is more refined.  I''d also crop off the top so the row of elephants is vertically centered, which would draw even more attention to them.</td>', 'What an excellent photo!  Your sense of light and color contrast is wonderful.  The subject matter is engrossing.  However, the composition is weak and the lighting is a bit flat.  Consider cropping off the right edge so the composition is more refined.  I''d also crop off the top so the row of elephants is vertically centered, which would draw even more attention to them.', '2004-09-21 12:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(919424, 106326, 25483, '<td valign="top">Nice looking Ass!!!!!<br/>Show us the rest</td>', 'Nice looking Ass!!!!!Show us the rest', '2004-09-21 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(919430, 106322, 26847, '<td valign="top">Crop the right negative space.  It''s not helping the subject matter.  It''s actually weakening the impact of your center of attention.  Also, consider adjusting your color.  The skin hue and color of light could be vibrant.  The green grass could be greener.</td>', 'Crop the right negative space.  It''s not helping the subject matter.  It''s actually weakening the impact of your center of attention.  Also, consider adjusting your color.  The skin hue and color of light could be vibrant.  The green grass could be greener.', '2004-09-21 13:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(919443, 106330, 26847, '<td valign="top">Looks more like dancing than fighting.  Excellent lighting, but the subject matter is far from convincing.</td>', 'Looks more like dancing than fighting.  Excellent lighting, but the subject matter is far from convincing.', '2004-09-21 13:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(919447, 105971, 26847, '<td valign="top">Considering how slow hot air balloons rise I wouldn''t consdier this to be a stop motion challenge.  It''s a very nice photo, however.  Great use of negative space!</td>', 'Considering how slow hot air balloons rise I wouldn''t consdier this to be a stop motion challenge.  It''s a very nice photo, however.  Great use of negative space!', '2004-09-21 13:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(919460, 106347, 26847, '<td valign="top">Hiow did you get all the pieces to fly in the air with shadows at different angles and without casting any shadows on the game below??? oh...that''s right...it''s fake.</td>', 'Hiow did you get all the pieces to fly in the air with shadows at different angles and without casting any shadows on the game below??? oh...that''s right...it''s fake.', '2004-09-21 13:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(919462, 106285, 26847, '<td valign="top">Hot air balloons simply don''t move fast enough to qualify as "stopped" motion.  But, the composition of the photo is very good.  The lighting is too neutral, however.</td>', 'Hot air balloons simply don''t move fast enough to qualify as "stopped" motion.  But, the composition of the photo is very good.  The lighting is too neutral, however.', '2004-09-21 13:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(919473, 106154, 26847, '<td valign="top">The lighting, contrast, color saturation and composition are all very weak.  FInally, this isn''t frozen motion.  It''s ALMOST frozen, but it''s still not what the challenge described.  Every aspect of the moving subject is blurred.  However, the subject matter is strong.  That''s a good start.  Most of the applicants haven''t succeeded in that.</td>', 'The lighting, contrast, color saturation and composition are all very weak.  FInally, this isn''t frozen motion.  It''s ALMOST frozen, but it''s still not what the challenge described.  Every aspect of the moving subject is blurred.  However, the subject matter is strong.  That''s a good start.  Most of the applicants haven''t succeeded in that.', '2004-09-21 13:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(919483, 106293, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  On this monitor, the birds heads look just a touch out of focus, but that might just be me?</td>', 'This is a great shot.  On this monitor, the birds heads look just a touch out of focus, but that might just be me?', '2004-09-21 13:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(919488, 105797, 13136, '<td valign="top">Great concept and good timing on the catch. Unfortunately, the background green seems to have been oversturated causing it to look like the the foreground was pasted onto it.</td>', 'Great concept and good timing on the catch. Unfortunately, the background green seems to have been oversturated causing it to look like the the foreground was pasted onto it.', '2004-09-21 13:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(919512, 106017, 22734, '<td valign="top">I have come back to this figure several times. It is a wonderful example of stopped motion. Yet, the image rises much higher in my estimation because there is something both ominous and exalting about it. It offers a mix of feelings. Anyway, this is an excellent capture with ample detail. Bumping up.</td>', 'I have come back to this figure several times. It is a wonderful example of stopped motion. Yet, the image rises much higher in my estimation because there is something both ominous and exalting about it. It offers a mix of feelings. Anyway, this is an excellent capture with ample detail. Bumping up.', '2004-09-21 13:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(919513, 106199, 13136, '<td valign="top">Wow. I''m sorry to see what happend to this shot. Was it bad resizing software. Way too faded.</td>', 'Wow. I''m sorry to see what happend to this shot. Was it bad resizing software. Way too faded.', '2004-09-21 14:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(919521, 106293, 26847, '<td valign="top">a very interesting photo.  What a shame the negative space on the left severely distracts from the subject.</td>', 'a very interesting photo.  What a shame the negative space on the left severely distracts from the subject.', '2004-09-21 14:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(919537, 106336, 26847, '<td valign="top">I would love to rate this photo higher.  However, the motion is not actually stopped.  It''s incredibly blurred.</td>', 'I would love to rate this photo higher.  However, the motion is not actually stopped.  It''s incredibly blurred.', '2004-09-21 14:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(919555, 106110, 3697, '<td valign="top">The colors and clarity are amazing.</td>', 'The colors and clarity are amazing.', '2004-09-21 14:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(919559, 106055, 22734, '<td valign="top">Quite an image with impeccable technique. All I can say is, "Wow !"</td>', 'Quite an image with impeccable technique. All I can say is, "Wow !"', '2004-09-21 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
