(921947, 106172, 23338, '<td valign="top">Careful !   You didn''t hit the camera, did you?  I''ve barely scratched the surface with PS, etc., so the ability to make all the grass pieces green and everything else gray still amazes me.  Never-the-less, you REALLY stopped the motion.  Hopefully you will also describe how you did it in your submission.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Careful !   You didn''t hit the camera, did you?  I''ve barely scratched the surface with PS, etc., so the ability to make all the grass pieces green and everything else gray still amazes me.  Never-the-less, you REALLY stopped the motion.  Hopefully you will also describe how you did it in your submission.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 17:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(921948, 106340, 4517, '<td valign="top">You must have been right in there to capture this great shot.</td>', 'You must have been right in there to capture this great shot.', '2004-09-22 17:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(921955, 106366, 23338, '<td valign="top">Feeling agressive, were we?  Very nice image.  I like the contrasts, the stopped action, and the overall graininess of the image.  It really works.  What did you do that highlighted the subject''s right arm and hand so much?  It makes it look slightly "unreal", but again, in the context of the whole image, it really is effective.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Feeling agressive, were we?  Very nice image.  I like the contrasts, the stopped action, and the overall graininess of the image.  It really works.  What did you do that highlighted the subject''s right arm and hand so much?  It makes it look slightly "unreal", but again, in the context of the whole image, it really is effective.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 17:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(921956, 106336, 4517, '<td valign="top">It`s a good photo but fails the challenge because of the motion blur.</td>', 'It`s a good photo but fails the challenge because of the motion blur.', '2004-09-22 17:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(921959, 105171, 23338, '<td valign="top">I keep looking for strings or something ...  Nice image.  Too bad that closest side of the target is so blurry.  Not sure if cropping would help or not.  But, it IS a cool image.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I keep looking for strings or something ...  Nice image.  Too bad that closest side of the target is so blurry.  Not sure if cropping would help or not.  But, it IS a cool image.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 17:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(921964, 106183, 4517, '<td valign="top">Now that aint easy.</td>', 'Now that aint easy.', '2004-09-22 17:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(921972, 106208, 23338, '<td valign="top">Oh, man ... that was probably so cold.  Really great shot, though.  I had no idea that so much water got displaced when someone flops into a pool.  Look at the size of the hole created.  And for the challenge, you sorta "froze" that water, didn''t you.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Oh, man ... that was probably so cold.  Really great shot, though.  I had no idea that so much water got displaced when someone flops into a pool.  Look at the size of the hole created.  And for the challenge, you sorta "froze" that water, didn''t you.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 17:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(921975, 106326, 10978, '<td valign="top">It is a nice idea, maybe with a black background or and solid color it would stand out more.</td>', 'It is a nice idea, maybe with a black background or and solid color it would stand out more.', '2004-09-22 17:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(921979, 106355, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very good, perfect timing. I`m not keen on square photos and would have cropped off top and bottom but thats my personal preference. 9 points.</td>', 'Very good, perfect timing. I`m not keen on square photos and would have cropped off top and bottom but thats my personal preference. 9 points.', '2004-09-22 17:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(921991, 105675, 4517, '<td valign="top">Now that must have been a fast shutter or was it done by flash. And how would you time when to release the shutter or was it tripped by remote. Anyway amazing shot, extra points for differculty.</td>', 'Now that must have been a fast shutter or was it done by flash. And how would you time when to release the shutter or was it tripped by remote. Anyway amazing shot, extra points for differculty.', '2004-09-22 17:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(921995, 106357, 4517, '<td valign="top">Lovely backdrop but not quite frozen it.</td>', 'Lovely backdrop but not quite frozen it.', '2004-09-22 17:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(921999, 105469, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good capture, shame about the bus.</td>', 'Good capture, shame about the bus.', '2004-09-22 17:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(922007, 106191, 4517, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used a minolta just incase you dropped it, nothing to lose :)  8</td>', 'I like the way you used a minolta just incase you dropped it, nothing to lose :)  8', '2004-09-22 17:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(922012, 106054, 4517, '<td valign="top">One of the better water drop shots.</td>', 'One of the better water drop shots.', '2004-09-22 18:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(922017, 106330, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very funny.</td>', 'Very funny.', '2004-09-22 18:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(922042, 106315, 20992, '<td valign="top">ooh I like this one! Very nice soft shadows turning to harder ones, the cup is slightly off centre, but now the drip is on 1/3rd of the photo: perfect! The colours are beautiful and I like the sphere you give with it through the title, it fits the scene well. Only thing that bothers me a bit is the handle (don''t know the right English word for it, in Holland we call it the ''ear'') seems a bit brushed on the right edge in photoshop (or something alike)..it''s not a crime though, but the hard edge seems a bit out of place.. even though I''ll give it a 10, also because you managed to give such an original twirl to a cliche thing..well done!!!</td>', 'ooh I like this one! Very nice soft shadows turning to harder ones, the cup is slightly off centre, but now the drip is on 1/3rd of the photo: perfect! The colours are beautiful and I like the sphere you give with it through the title, it fits the scene well. Only thing that bothers me a bit is the handle (don''t know the right English word for it, in Holland we call it the ''ear'') seems a bit brushed on the right edge in photoshop (or something alike)..it''s not a crime though, but the hard edge seems a bit out of place.. even though I''ll give it a 10, also because you managed to give such an original twirl to a cliche thing..well done!!!', '2004-09-22 18:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(922049, 105848, 20992, '<td valign="top">this one made me say: wow..... the first second I saw it...<br/>What ISN''T great about it?? This must be a ribbon winner, must be!<br/>Love the soft tones, the bridge on the background is beautifully picked, if it was only the sky, I wouldn''t have find it this nice..the bird is nicely caught here, all details are visible and there are absolutely no motion marks, good placement (on the end of the bridge and slightly off centre)...great job!!! This will do great in DCPrints too I guess..--&gt; 10!!!</td>', 'this one made me say: wow..... the first second I saw it...What ISN''T great about it?? This must be a ribbon winner, must be!Love the soft tones, the bridge on the background is beautifully picked, if it was only the sky, I wouldn''t have find it this nice..the bird is nicely caught here, all details are visible and there are absolutely no motion marks, good placement (on the end of the bridge and slightly off centre)...great job!!! This will do great in DCPrints too I guess..--> 10!!!', '2004-09-22 18:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(922060, 105871, 23338, '<td valign="top">I don''t see that there was any motion stopped; and your title infers that everything was "pit stopped" when the image was taken.  Now, if you had kneeled in the street and taken that image while the car was coming at you 60 mph, THEN you would have stopped some motion.  As it is though, I don''t think it qualifies.</td>', 'I don''t see that there was any motion stopped; and your title infers that everything was "pit stopped" when the image was taken.  Now, if you had kneeled in the street and taken that image while the car was coming at you 60 mph, THEN you would have stopped some motion.  As it is though, I don''t think it qualifies.', '2004-09-22 18:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(922062, 105971, 20992, '<td valign="top">lovely!!!! Colours just splash from my screen here!! I like the see-through especially and the sharpness and brightness of the balloons! The right balloon being just that bit bigger than the left one, compensates for the centred composition keeping it from being boring. You''ve got yourself a 10!</td>', 'lovely!!!! Colours just splash from my screen here!! I like the see-through especially and the sharpness and brightness of the balloons! The right balloon being just that bit bigger than the left one, compensates for the centred composition keeping it from being boring. You''ve got yourself a 10!', '2004-09-22 18:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(922069, 106331, 23338, '<td valign="top">I know there is some motion here, both from the bird and from the water.  I just am not attracted to the image.  It has this big brown area intruding on the lower left and the actual duck is really hard to "see".  It is only after really struggling with it that you realize that is it''s RIGHT eye and the head is inverted over on it''s side to be scratched.    And the brown part toward the back of the duck seems out of focus.  It''s just not a comfortable image for me to ponder.  Good luck in the challenge, though.</td>', 'I know there is some motion here, both from the bird and from the water.  I just am not attracted to the image.  It has this big brown area intruding on the lower left and the actual duck is really hard to "see".  It is only after really struggling with it that you realize that is it''s RIGHT eye and the head is inverted over on it''s side to be scratched.    And the brown part toward the back of the duck seems out of focus.  It''s just not a comfortable image for me to ponder.  Good luck in the challenge, though.', '2004-09-22 18:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(922076, 106183, 20992, '<td valign="top">validated??? Why??? (my guess is that there was someone underneath him throwing the extra fruit). I think this shot is very humouristic and still nice to look at!</td>', 'validated??? Why??? (my guess is that there was someone underneath him throwing the extra fruit). I think this shot is very humouristic and still nice to look at!', '2004-09-22 18:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(922080, 106225, 23338, '<td valign="top">If you had been able to capture the wings all the way up, this would have rated a lot higher with me.  As it is, I wonder what the rest of the bird looked like.  And, the top of that which I CAN see seems very soft.  I really like the colors and the contrast though.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'If you had been able to capture the wings all the way up, this would have rated a lot higher with me.  As it is, I wonder what the rest of the bird looked like.  And, the top of that which I CAN see seems very soft.  I really like the colors and the contrast though.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 18:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(922087, 106199, 23338, '<td valign="top">Ok, you stopped the motion.  That''s good.  Now you have to work on getting focus or correcting whatever gave you all the grain.  In addition, if you were slightly higher and aimed down, you could eliminate the intrusive background subjects which detract from the overall image.  That''s just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, you stopped the motion.  That''s good.  Now you have to work on getting focus or correcting whatever gave you all the grain.  In addition, if you were slightly higher and aimed down, you could eliminate the intrusive background subjects which detract from the overall image.  That''s just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 18:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(922094, 106285, 23338, '<td valign="top">The problem for me with this image is that I know those balloons were moving, but not very fast and they''re pretty far away from the photographer.  That means you could have totally stopped them with a shutter speed of 1/16th of a second or less.  To me, stopped motion would have been something that, even when stopped, infers motion - and it probably took 1/250th of a second or faster to accomplish.  Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'The problem for me with this image is that I know those balloons were moving, but not very fast and they''re pretty far away from the photographer.  That means you could have totally stopped them with a shutter speed of 1/16th of a second or less.  To me, stopped motion would have been something that, even when stopped, infers motion - and it probably took 1/250th of a second or faster to accomplish.  Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 18:52:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(922097, 106340, 20992, '<td valign="top">I find this picture interesting...it is documentary and perfect for that matter! On the other hand creeps up the feeling that this is a scene I find very sad...I feel pity for the animals (and I don''t know whether that''s correct, maybe the pigs liked the running? I have never seen something like this before...) Apart from that the colours are all in tune, I find it especially very good that you''ve managed to catch the moment...the animals are definitely running, still it''s stopped motion! The numbers on the backs are still visible adding more information to the picture, the crowd on the background, blurred, but still visible enough...perfect picture, but with a slight cruel (for me) feeling in it... ---&gt; 10</td>', 'I find this picture interesting...it is documentary and perfect for that matter! On the other hand creeps up the feeling that this is a scene I find very sad...I feel pity for the animals (and I don''t know whether that''s correct, maybe the pigs liked the running? I have never seen something like this before...) Apart from that the colours are all in tune, I find it especially very good that you''ve managed to catch the moment...the animals are definitely running, still it''s stopped motion! The numbers on the backs are still visible adding more information to the picture, the crowd on the background, blurred, but still visible enough...perfect picture, but with a slight cruel (for me) feeling in it... ---> 10', '2004-09-22 18:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(922101, 105971, 23338, '<td valign="top">I rated you higher than the other hot air balloon image because I really love the composition and the colors of yours.  The problem for me with this image is that I know those balloons were moving, but not very fast and they''re pretty far away from the photographer.  That means you could have totally stopped them with a shutter speed of 1/16th of a second or less.  To me, stopped motion would have been something that, even when stopped, infers motion - and it probably took 1/250th of a second or faster to accomplish.  Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I rated you higher than the other hot air balloon image because I really love the composition and the colors of yours.  The problem for me with this image is that I know those balloons were moving, but not very fast and they''re pretty far away from the photographer.  That means you could have totally stopped them with a shutter speed of 1/16th of a second or less.  To me, stopped motion would have been something that, even when stopped, infers motion - and it probably took 1/250th of a second or faster to accomplish.  Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 18:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(922104, 105991, 23338, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird - stopped pretty well also.  Except for the edges of the left wing which look kinda soft.  Unfortunately, the overall image just lacks something for me.   It seems so cluttered and unpretty compared to the bird - and as a result, it detracts from the image.   Get lower, shoot up, and use the sky for a background.  Just my thoughts.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty bird - stopped pretty well also.  Except for the edges of the left wing which look kinda soft.  Unfortunately, the overall image just lacks something for me.   It seems so cluttered and unpretty compared to the bird - and as a result, it detracts from the image.   Get lower, shoot up, and use the sky for a background.  Just my thoughts.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 18:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(922117, 106211, 23338, '<td valign="top">Well, maybe there was some motion - the left front paw?  Anyway, that''s the part that is out of focus.   Nice eyes and face, both color-wise and focus-wise.   I''d like to see much more indication of movement - maybe jumping or something?  And then REALLY stop it - no motion, PURR-fect focus, great detail.  Every hair showing.  Anyway, those are my thoughts.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, maybe there was some motion - the left front paw?  Anyway, that''s the part that is out of focus.   Nice eyes and face, both color-wise and focus-wise.   I''d like to see much more indication of movement - maybe jumping or something?  And then REALLY stop it - no motion, PURR-fect focus, great detail.  Every hair showing.  Anyway, those are my thoughts.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-22 19:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(922123, 106181, 23338, '<td valign="top">Really hard to tell what is happening with this image.  But, I DO have to hold my nose to observe it.  :-)   Whatever is happening doesn''t infer much motion - except one little drip thing on the top of the egg, some ooze that may be coming out of it, and the possibility that gravity is at work.    If I were trying to work with a similar subject, I might have tried to drop it on a hard surface and catch the cracking and splattering - maybe some mid-air drops or pieces - something to show that you had really stopped motion.  Anyway, that''s just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Really hard to tell what is happening with this image.  But, I DO have to hold my nose to observe it.  :-)   Whatever is happening doesn''t infer much motion - except one little drip thing on the top of the egg, some ooze that may be coming out of it, and the possibility that gravity is at work.    If I were trying to work with a similar subject, I might have tried to drop it on a hard surface and catch the cracking and splattering - maybe some mid-air drops or pieces - something to show that you had really stopped motion.  Anyway, that''s just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 19:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(922128, 106154, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nice image; good background for it.  However, and the title alluded to it, he was moving too fast for your shutter speed to stop him.  And the object of this challenge was just that: to stop him.   Faster shutter speed would have helped in this case.  That''s my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Nice image; good background for it.  However, and the title alluded to it, he was moving too fast for your shutter speed to stop him.  And the object of this challenge was just that: to stop him.   Faster shutter speed would have helped in this case.  That''s my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 19:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(922133, 106009, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nicely stopped, but the overall image suffers from being too dark and having too much distracting detail in the background.  I would get higher, shoot down and maybe use some fill flash also.  That''s just my opinion, and I could be wrong.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely stopped, but the overall image suffers from being too dark and having too much distracting detail in the background.  I would get higher, shoot down and maybe use some fill flash also.  That''s just my opinion, and I could be wrong.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-22 19:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(922140, 106183, 24642, '<td valign="top">Lively, joyful and full of tension.  The shadows on hte shirt are really fantastic.  Great job.</td>', 'Lively, joyful and full of tension.  The shadows on hte shirt are really fantastic.  Great job.', '2004-09-22 19:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(922144, 106208, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very powerful.</td>', 'Very powerful.', '2004-09-22 19:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(922153, 106357, 24642, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot,  great colors in the lower part.  The persons hands aren''t pin sharp and the sky could maybe be more lively with some burning.  Anyways good shot.</td>', 'A beautiful shot,  great colors in the lower part.  The persons hands aren''t pin sharp and the sky could maybe be more lively with some burning.  Anyways good shot.', '2004-09-22 19:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(922176, 105681, 24805, '<td valign="top">sweet! it isn''t flawless, but it is incredible. well done!</td>', 'sweet! it isn''t flawless, but it is incredible. well done!', '2004-09-22 19:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(922182, 106355, 24805, '<td valign="top">all right, where''s the trampoline?? seriously, this is very good. the overcast lighting and "homey" background detract from its effectiveness, but it is a great pose.</td>', 'all right, where''s the trampoline?? seriously, this is very good. the overcast lighting and "homey" background detract from its effectiveness, but it is a great pose.', '2004-09-22 19:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(922183, 106357, 24805, '<td valign="top">the pose is great and the background is great. i aesthetically need more contrast between the left leg and the background and some negative space to cushion the right hand. this image is in an awkward spot somewhere between focused and blurred that makes it look like you tried to freeze it but didn''t have the shutter fast enough. your results would be more dynamic if you picked one or the other.</td>', 'the pose is great and the background is great. i aesthetically need more contrast between the left leg and the background and some negative space to cushion the right hand. this image is in an awkward spot somewhere between focused and blurred that makes it look like you tried to freeze it but didn''t have the shutter fast enough. your results would be more dynamic if you picked one or the other.', '2004-09-22 19:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(922184, 106125, 24805, '<td valign="top">yeah dude!</td>', 'yeah dude!', '2004-09-22 19:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(922185, 106285, 15497, '<td valign="top">A man is flying in a hot air balloon and realizes he is lost. He reduces height and spots a man down below. He lowers the balloon further and shouts, "Excuse me, can you tell me where I am?" <br/>The man below says, "Yes, you''re in a hot air balloon, hovering 30 feet above this field."<br/> <br/>"You must be an engineer," says the balloonist. <br/> <br/>"I am," replies the man. "How did you know?" <br/> <br/>"Well," says the balloonist, "Everything you have told me is technically correct, but it''s of no use to anyone."<br/> <br/>The man below says, "You must be in management." <br/> <br/>"I am," replies the balloonist, "But how did you know?"<br/> <br/>"Well," says the man, "You don''t know where you are, or where you''re going, but you expect me to be able to help. You''re in the same position you were before we met, but now it''s my fault."</td>', 'A man is flying in a hot air balloon and realizes he is lost. He reduces height and spots a man down below. He lowers the balloon further and shouts, "Excuse me, can you tell me where I am?" The man below says, "Yes, you''re in a hot air balloon, hovering 30 feet above this field." "You must be an engineer," says the balloonist.  "I am," replies the man. "How did you know?"  "Well," says the balloonist, "Everything you have told me is technically correct, but it''s of no use to anyone." The man below says, "You must be in management."  "I am," replies the balloonist, "But how did you know?" "Well," says the man, "You don''t know where you are, or where you''re going, but you expect me to be able to help. You''re in the same position you were before we met, but now it''s my fault."', '2004-09-22 19:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(922192, 106002, 24805, '<td valign="top">yes! i love it! the subject that is, the picture feels like it has a fairly careless composition (cropped too far on the left, it includes the path and ropes, etc. a dark unobtrusive background to contrast the water would make this incredible!</td>', 'yes! i love it! the subject that is, the picture feels like it has a fairly careless composition (cropped too far on the left, it includes the path and ropes, etc. a dark unobtrusive background to contrast the water would make this incredible!', '2004-09-22 19:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(922193, 106239, 15497, '<td valign="top">Leave some for me please! I''m giving you a 10, mostly because I made me wanna go out and drink tonight. :-)</td>', 'Leave some for me please! I''m giving you a 10, mostly because I made me wanna go out and drink tonight. :-)', '2004-09-22 19:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(922195, 106096, 24805, '<td valign="top">;o)</td>', ';o)', '2004-09-22 19:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(922198, 106363, 24846, '<td valign="top">The shadow of the drop is great, love the black and white, great composition.</td>', 'The shadow of the drop is great, love the black and white, great composition.', '2004-09-22 19:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(922201, 105991, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice. Despite not the front, I love the fan of the tail, must''ve been a hard capture.</td>', 'Nice. Despite not the front, I love the fan of the tail, must''ve been a hard capture.', '2004-09-22 19:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(922202, 105855, 24846, '<td valign="top">Wonderful doflove the arch of the wings.</td>', 'Wonderful doflove the arch of the wings.', '2004-09-22 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(922208, 106312, 24846, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a sweet shot. Look forward to how you did that -10-</td>', 'Wow, what a sweet shot. Look forward to how you did that -10-', '2004-09-22 19:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(922211, 106347, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. It is hands down one of my favorites this week. Only thing I might like to see is a black background to give a little more definition to the game. But I''m not sure that would change anything. <br/> <br/>Excellent! 10</td>', 'I love this shot. It is hands down one of my favorites this week. Only thing I might like to see is a black background to give a little more definition to the game. But I''m not sure that would change anything.  Excellent! 10', '2004-09-22 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(922214, 106055, 24846, '<td valign="top">An eye popper ! Wonder how many bulbs you used? A serious ribbon contender in my mind. -10-</td>', 'An eye popper ! Wonder how many bulbs you used? A serious ribbon contender in my mind. -10-', '2004-09-22 20:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(922242, 106353, 24846, '<td valign="top">Hard shots to get...</td>', 'Hard shots to get...', '2004-09-22 20:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(922250, 106095, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion. Love the glean of light in the water, thelighting of the urn, the dof and espicially the crop and border. -8-</td>', 'Nice compostion. Love the glean of light in the water, thelighting of the urn, the dof and espicially the crop and border. -8-', '2004-09-22 20:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(922253, 106307, 24846, '<td valign="top">Whoa, were ya hang glidding? Nice capture</td>', 'Whoa, were ya hang glidding? Nice capture', '2004-09-22 20:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(922260, 106054, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lovely rainbow. I don''t care what peole say about water shots, I love seeing them, especially one as well compsoed as this -10-</td>', 'Lovely rainbow. I don''t care what peole say about water shots, I love seeing them, especially one as well compsoed as this -10-', '2004-09-22 20:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(922265, 106370, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the backgound pedestrian cars in full motion, the trailing car in semimotion, and the leader in stopped motion. -9-</td>', 'Great shot, love the backgound pedestrian cars in full motion, the trailing car in semimotion, and the leader in stopped motion. -9-', '2004-09-22 20:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(922279, 105631, 24846, '<td valign="top">Another great water shot, love all the nice capture,each as unique as a person. When you study this and others you can really see the complexity (oh, oh, wonder what we''ll see in that challenge. I love the top drop trying to catch up to the top. Nice rippling and colors. -9-</td>', 'Another great water shot, love all the nice capture,each as unique as a person. When you study this and others you can really see the complexity (oh, oh, wonder what we''ll see in that challenge. I love the top drop trying to catch up to the top. Nice rippling and colors. -9-', '2004-09-22 20:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
