(923305, 105681, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture !  I love the duotones and low-key image, as well as, the angled cropping.  The lighting is wonderful and you also did a very good job of burning around the edges and corners.    This is an exceptional stopped motion picture.</td>', 'Very cool picture !  I love the duotones and low-key image, as well as, the angled cropping.  The lighting is wonderful and you also did a very good job of burning around the edges and corners.    This is an exceptional stopped motion picture.', '2004-09-23 11:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(923311, 105936, 5822, '<td valign="top">Technically I guess you could say you accomplished a stopped motion image, but one without artistic merit, imo. The background, besides being underexposed and ugly, has no relation to the subject.  I think with a bit more expousre you could have whitened the milk more to have greater impact.  The one thing I do like in this picture is the milk droplets that appear to float in space.</td>', 'Technically I guess you could say you accomplished a stopped motion image, but one without artistic merit, imo. The background, besides being underexposed and ugly, has no relation to the subject.  I think with a bit more expousre you could have whitened the milk more to have greater impact.  The one thing I do like in this picture is the milk droplets that appear to float in space.', '2004-09-23 11:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(923316, 105775, 18197, '<td valign="top">The bubble part of the photo is great. The background is not. Unfortunately the background distracts and detracts from your main subject rather than acting to draw attention to it.</td>', 'The bubble part of the photo is great. The background is not. Unfortunately the background distracts and detracts from your main subject rather than acting to draw attention to it.', '2004-09-23 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(923329, 106307, 5822, '<td valign="top">The muted tones of the background are wonderful but your subject fills such a small portion of the frame, and is so poorly lit that it is hard to see and detracts from the overall impact of this image, which has a lot of potential.  If you could have zoomed in more, and shot the image at a time of the day that would have assured better lighting it would have improved the results.</td>', 'The muted tones of the background are wonderful but your subject fills such a small portion of the frame, and is so poorly lit that it is hard to see and detracts from the overall impact of this image, which has a lot of potential.  If you could have zoomed in more, and shot the image at a time of the day that would have assured better lighting it would have improved the results.', '2004-09-23 12:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(923344, 106054, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. My favorite water drop for this challenge, and there is some keen competition.</td>', 'Nicely done. My favorite water drop for this challenge, and there is some keen competition.', '2004-09-23 12:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
