(923359, 105675, 19608, '<td valign="top">WOWZERS!  Now that''s what I call stop action!  Even though you had little control over what shapes would evolve - it is a really pleasing composition.  Not to mention your choice of balloon color, background and lighting setup are perfect.  If this one doesn''t win the blue..... I''ll be shocked.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-27 12:12:06.</i></td>', 'WOWZERS!  Now that''s what I call stop action!  Even though you had little control over what shapes would evolve - it is a really pleasing composition.  Not to mention your choice of balloon color, background and lighting setup are perfect.  If this one doesn''t win the blue..... I''ll be shocked.', '2004-09-23 12:36:13.000000', '2004-09-27 13:12:06.000000', 1),
(923362, 106208, 19608, '<td valign="top">There are very few shots that are packed full of total WOW - but this is one of them.  Could it be possible that this was a "first try" - as her clothes don''t even look wet yet!  I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t finish 2nd!  (I know that''s a risky prediction, but it''s my guess.) Everything is just "right" - congratulations on a superb entry.</td>', 'There are very few shots that are packed full of total WOW - but this is one of them.  Could it be possible that this was a "first try" - as her clothes don''t even look wet yet!  I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t finish 2nd!  (I know that''s a risky prediction, but it''s my guess.) Everything is just "right" - congratulations on a superb entry.', '2004-09-23 12:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
