(923371, 106055, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great stop motion image that has wonderful duotones and interesting composition.  The low-key really makes the subject stand out and this image has great impact. Very well done.</td>', 'Great stop motion image that has wonderful duotones and interesting composition.  The low-key really makes the subject stand out and this image has great impact. Very well done.', '2004-09-23 12:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
