(923428, 106239, 509, '<td valign="top">You caught the alcohol pour well, but the rest of the shot suffers.  The shutter speed might not have been fast enough - there is still blur no the woman''s body (particularly noticeable in the higher contrast areas).  The lighting is a little harsh as well.  This and the overall warm color balance might have been helped by desaturating all but the bottle.</td>', 'You caught the alcohol pour well, but the rest of the shot suffers.  The shutter speed might not have been fast enough - there is still blur no the woman''s body (particularly noticeable in the higher contrast areas).  The lighting is a little harsh as well.  This and the overall warm color balance might have been helped by desaturating all but the bottle.', '2004-09-23 13:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(923430, 105723, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting created by the kite, it offsets the silhouette of the surfer well.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'I like the backlighting created by the kite, it offsets the silhouette of the surfer well.  Very nice shot.', '2004-09-23 13:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(923432, 106181, 509, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting, combined with egg''s appearance of being out of focus detract from this.  Also, the only clear "motion" is the small bit of yolk dripping at the top - it doesn''t really sell this as a stopped motion shot.</td>', 'The harsh lighting, combined with egg''s appearance of being out of focus detract from this.  Also, the only clear "motion" is the small bit of yolk dripping at the top - it doesn''t really sell this as a stopped motion shot.', '2004-09-23 13:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(923435, 106309, 509, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable capture!  They were just doing this for fun? lol Very original and sure to do well -10-</td>', 'Unbelievable capture!  They were just doing this for fun? lol Very original and sure to do well -10-', '2004-09-23 13:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(923440, 106150, 509, '<td valign="top">Might be strengthened by a little more contrast in post processing.  I think a more interesting approach might have been to clearly skew the stripes to a point in the composition (maybe just rotating the shot to aim more at the corners if you know what I mean).  This would just be a different presentation, but it could potentially make this more memorable.</td>', 'Might be strengthened by a little more contrast in post processing.  I think a more interesting approach might have been to clearly skew the stripes to a point in the composition (maybe just rotating the shot to aim more at the corners if you know what I mean).  This would just be a different presentation, but it could potentially make this more memorable.', '2004-09-23 13:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(923441, 106126, 509, '<td valign="top">Great abstract.  I love the lighting, color and even the almost industrial-looking backdrop.  Well done.</td>', 'Great abstract.  I love the lighting, color and even the almost industrial-looking backdrop.  Well done.', '2004-09-23 13:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
