(923641, 106185, 19608, '<td valign="top">A nice idea.  The positioning of the horse doesn''t really suggest fast movement - so it would probably be stronger with a different gait.  Exposure right on, composition well planned.</td>', 'A nice idea.  The positioning of the horse doesn''t really suggest fast movement - so it would probably be stronger with a different gait.  Exposure right on, composition well planned.', '2004-09-23 16:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
