(923685, 106239, 13136, '<td valign="top">There is an awful lot of double imaging in this shot. Also the exposure is too bright. The fluid looks like it was stopped well, but it''s size in the overall picture makes it hard to tell for sure.</td>', 'There is an awful lot of double imaging in this shot. Also the exposure is too bright. The fluid looks like it was stopped well, but it''s size in the overall picture makes it hard to tell for sure.', '2004-09-23 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
