(923956, 105653, 21643, '<td valign="top">Great photo! How many attempts did it take to get the pieces in the right spots? This turned out great, not only technically but also in terms of what it conveys. <br/></td>', 'Great photo! How many attempts did it take to get the pieces in the right spots? This turned out great, not only technically but also in terms of what it conveys. ', '2004-09-23 20:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
