(924312, 106347, 24846, '<td valign="top">Now I know what to do with those kids games in the closet. Great pespective, dof, colors..</td>', 'Now I know what to do with those kids games in the closet. Great pespective, dof, colors..', '2004-09-24 00:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(924439, 105936, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent work for this challenge</td>', 'Excellent work for this challenge', '2004-09-24 05:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(924440, 105675, 16046, '<td valign="top">pretty amazing, good choice of color</td>', 'pretty amazing, good choice of color', '2004-09-24 05:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(924441, 106183, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great work, excellent illusion</td>', 'Great work, excellent illusion', '2004-09-24 05:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(924443, 106150, 16046, '<td valign="top">very clever and well shot</td>', 'very clever and well shot', '2004-09-24 05:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(924445, 106326, 16046, '<td valign="top">nice rear, would be a better shot without tatoo, still good work</td>', 'nice rear, would be a better shot without tatoo, still good work', '2004-09-24 05:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(924446, 106335, 16046, '<td valign="top">wow, that''s cool, good catch</td>', 'wow, that''s cool, good catch', '2004-09-24 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(924448, 106366, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very good work, nice retro feel to it.</td>', 'Very good work, nice retro feel to it.', '2004-09-24 05:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(924450, 106055, 16046, '<td valign="top">good timing shot, well done</td>', 'good timing shot, well done', '2004-09-24 05:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(924451, 106010, 16046, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can feel this one, very cool</td>', 'Yes, I can feel this one, very cool', '2004-09-24 05:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(924452, 105681, 16046, '<td valign="top">very nice b&amp;w, good contrast</td>', 'very nice b&w, good contrast', '2004-09-24 05:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(924453, 106050, 16046, '<td valign="top">amazing shot, well done</td>', 'amazing shot, well done', '2004-09-24 05:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(924455, 106307, 16046, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-09-24 05:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(924457, 106208, 16046, '<td valign="top">cool, nice work</td>', 'cool, nice work', '2004-09-24 05:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(924458, 105316, 16046, '<td valign="top">love the color here, should sell a lot of prints</td>', 'love the color here, should sell a lot of prints', '2004-09-24 06:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(924459, 105653, 16046, '<td valign="top">clever idea, you must have done this before.</td>', 'clever idea, you must have done this before.', '2004-09-24 06:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(924481, 106244, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think i recognize the uniform...</td>', 'i think i recognize the uniform...', '2004-09-24 07:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(924494, 106009, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice action, but a bit dark.</td>', 'Nice action, but a bit dark.', '2004-09-24 08:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(924495, 106319, 9073, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones. The neck curve compliments the back curve beautifully, and you''ve done an excellent job in composing to bring this out. Maybe a touch dark on the face, but that, too, is balanced by the darkness under the body. I think that a tighter cropping top and bottom would help to emphasise the length more. 8</td>', 'Lovely tones. The neck curve compliments the back curve beautifully, and you''ve done an excellent job in composing to bring this out. Maybe a touch dark on the face, but that, too, is balanced by the darkness under the body. I think that a tighter cropping top and bottom would help to emphasise the length more. 8', '2004-09-24 08:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(924497, 105499, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice panning and an effective tilt. If it weren''t for he overblown top windscreen and the bland sky, this would make for an excellent product shot. 6</td>', 'Nice panning and an effective tilt. If it weren''t for he overblown top windscreen and the bland sky, this would make for an excellent product shot. 6', '2004-09-24 08:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(924498, 106107, 9073, '<td valign="top">Good composition. The important face area is overpowered by the very bright building its right. Some dodging would have helped here.</td>', 'Good composition. The important face area is overpowered by the very bright building its right. Some dodging would have helped here.', '2004-09-24 08:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(924500, 105644, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice, graphic treatment of a very simple subject. Lovely texture on the tap itself. The border works well as does the bottom curved lighting. The water droplets themselves are beautifully captured. 9<br/></td>', 'Nice, graphic treatment of a very simple subject. Lovely texture on the tap itself. The border works well as does the bottom curved lighting. The water droplets themselves are beautifully captured. 9', '2004-09-24 08:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(924501, 105681, 9073, '<td valign="top">Very effective lighting, well done. Some more crispness on the foot on the left would have been nice. 7</td>', 'Very effective lighting, well done. Some more crispness on the foot on the left would have been nice. 7', '2004-09-24 08:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(924502, 106125, 9073, '<td valign="top">A much tighter cropping is needed here.</td>', 'A much tighter cropping is needed here.', '2004-09-24 08:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(924503, 105991, 9073, '<td valign="top">I feel that this scene is too complicated. There''s the bird, the stones, the log and the greenery. Maybe it''s the dof, which puts the top of the stones upwards out of focus. I think that this would have worked better with every element in full focus or taken from a higher angle to eliminate the conflicting top elements.</td>', 'I feel that this scene is too complicated. There''s the bird, the stones, the log and the greenery. Maybe it''s the dof, which puts the top of the stones upwards out of focus. I think that this would have worked better with every element in full focus or taken from a higher angle to eliminate the conflicting top elements.', '2004-09-24 08:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(924504, 106205, 10110, '<td valign="top">great use of negative space, good solid background and nice subject placement. I think maybe oversharpened though?</td>', 'great use of negative space, good solid background and nice subject placement. I think maybe oversharpened though?', '2004-09-24 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(924505, 106179, 9073, '<td valign="top">This is just a plane in a very bland sky. You need to have at least two interesting elemnents in a successful photo. This is bland. 2</td>', 'This is just a plane in a very bland sky. You need to have at least two interesting elemnents in a successful photo. This is bland. 2', '2004-09-24 08:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(924507, 106370, 9073, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of including the white bars - they really add to the ''whizz'' effect. Unfortunately, the panning is ever-so-slightly off. Too bad. 5</td>', 'I really like the idea of including the white bars - they really add to the ''whizz'' effect. Unfortunately, the panning is ever-so-slightly off. Too bad. 5', '2004-09-24 08:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(924509, 106357, 9073, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! My only suggestion is to have the body completely clear of the hills to complete the effect. 8</td>', 'Fantastic! My only suggestion is to have the body completely clear of the hills to complete the effect. 8', '2004-09-24 08:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(924512, 106350, 9073, '<td valign="top">A top angle flattens the perspective, resulting in a flat shot. To get more sence of action, you need to get down to the same, or lower, angle and zoom right into the action. That would also help reduce the negative impact of the carpet. 4</td>', 'A top angle flattens the perspective, resulting in a flat shot. To get more sence of action, you need to get down to the same, or lower, angle and zoom right into the action. That would also help reduce the negative impact of the carpet. 4', '2004-09-24 08:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(924513, 106293, 9073, '<td valign="top">Some burning on the wings would have helped this already wonderful shot. 7</td>', 'Some burning on the wings would have helped this already wonderful shot. 7', '2004-09-24 08:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(924515, 105730, 9073, '<td valign="top">Great dof.</td>', 'Great dof.', '2004-09-24 08:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(924516, 106010, 16493, '<td valign="top">Just a touch of motion blur or it would be perfect</td>', 'Just a touch of motion blur or it would be perfect', '2004-09-24 08:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(924517, 106199, 16636, '<td valign="top">seems very dull - was this taken through a window?</td>', 'seems very dull - was this taken through a window?', '2004-09-24 08:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(924523, 105631, 9073, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and a nice composition. 7</td>', 'Lovely colours and a nice composition. 7', '2004-09-24 08:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(924529, 105646, 9073, '<td valign="top">Great timing!</td>', 'Great timing!', '2004-09-24 08:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(924532, 106173, 9073, '<td valign="top">Neat Image gets a bad press for its overuse, but sometimes, you need to use it.</td>', 'Neat Image gets a bad press for its overuse, but sometimes, you need to use it.', '2004-09-24 08:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(924541, 106336, 18450, '<td valign="top">WOW....Good shot!! Love the way you''ve caught the drops of water in this.</td>', 'WOW....Good shot!! Love the way you''ve caught the drops of water in this.', '2004-09-24 08:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(924546, 105675, 9073, '<td valign="top">Stunning. My only 10 of this challenge so far.</td>', 'Stunning. My only 10 of this challenge so far.', '2004-09-24 09:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(924547, 105316, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s really nice to have several variations on this theme in the challenge.  All are different and show individual creativity.  Yours is especially well done in the color arena - it''s a very nice pallette.  The only areas of concern is the white areas that show little or no detail, but they don''t detract that much.  The centered composition works great for this.  You captured the action (and stopped it well) at the very peak.  A well done effort!</td>', 'It''s really nice to have several variations on this theme in the challenge.  All are different and show individual creativity.  Yours is especially well done in the color arena - it''s a very nice pallette.  The only areas of concern is the white areas that show little or no detail, but they don''t detract that much.  The centered composition works great for this.  You captured the action (and stopped it well) at the very peak.  A well done effort!', '2004-09-24 09:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(924548, 106055, 18450, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!</td>', 'Stunning!!', '2004-09-24 09:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(924549, 106054, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s really great to have several people submit similar images on a theme. We get to see each artist''s individual creativity.  I like you choice of composition with the action at the RoT.  Your background - the area behind the drop is soft - which really makes the water drop pop out.  The white area of the water to the left of the drop is a bit too powerful.  Perfect capture at the peak of the action.</td>', 'It''s really great to have several people submit similar images on a theme. We get to see each artist''s individual creativity.  I like you choice of composition with the action at the RoT.  Your background - the area behind the drop is soft - which really makes the water drop pop out.  The white area of the water to the left of the drop is a bit too powerful.  Perfect capture at the peak of the action.', '2004-09-24 09:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(924552, 105927, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a dfficult shot to pull off and you certainly had loads of folks who tried it along with you.  You have captured the action very well in a monochromatic mode.  The "extra" small drop above the main one is a super addition.</td>', 'This is a dfficult shot to pull off and you certainly had loads of folks who tried it along with you.  You have captured the action very well in a monochromatic mode.  The "extra" small drop above the main one is a super addition.', '2004-09-24 09:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(924553, 105631, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very popular theme this challenge - but each one is different.  It''s nice to see the variety.  Yours is the most "moody" of the group, mostly due to its darker colors and monochromatic effect.  It''s a great capture of the drop and its little sidekick!  The black border really overpowers the image - way overdone.  May be cropped a wee bit too close on the top.</td>', 'A very popular theme this challenge - but each one is different.  It''s nice to see the variety.  Yours is the most "moody" of the group, mostly due to its darker colors and monochromatic effect.  It''s a great capture of the drop and its little sidekick!  The black border really overpowers the image - way overdone.  May be cropped a wee bit too close on the top.', '2004-09-24 09:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(924554, 105576, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - most seemed to go for the single droplet.  Good action - but perhaps a bit soft.  The white line in the border doesn''t help - especially where the little drop is bisected by the line.</td>', 'Nice idea - most seemed to go for the single droplet.  Good action - but perhaps a bit soft.  The white line in the border doesn''t help - especially where the little drop is bisected by the line.', '2004-09-24 09:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(924556, 106110, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, composition is fine.  The out of focus zones of confusion are way distracting.</td>', 'The colors are nice, composition is fine.  The out of focus zones of confusion are way distracting.', '2004-09-24 09:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(924564, 106010, 17551, '<td valign="top">Bet you had a time cleaning that up.. super shot. Interesting choice of background color.</td>', 'Bet you had a time cleaning that up.. super shot. Interesting choice of background color.', '2004-09-24 09:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
