(924893, 106002, 26045, '<td valign="top">This is phenomenal! Too bad about the ropes in the background...and have you tried this in BW? A zoom in might help...but it''s just so damn cool!!<br/></td>', 'This is phenomenal! Too bad about the ropes in the background...and have you tried this in BW? A zoom in might help...but it''s just so damn cool!!', '2004-09-24 14:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(924895, 105716, 26045, '<td valign="top">very very nice capture!</td>', 'very very nice capture!', '2004-09-24 14:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(924908, 105971, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure it''s a really good subject for the challenge (I mean, they aren''t exactly speedy objects that have to be captured at a lightning fast shutter speed)... but this is an otherwise AWESOME shot!  I love the colors!</td>', 'I''m not sure it''s a really good subject for the challenge (I mean, they aren''t exactly speedy objects that have to be captured at a lightning fast shutter speed)... but this is an otherwise AWESOME shot!  I love the colors!', '2004-09-24 14:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(924964, 106355, 25140, '<td valign="top">The sharp contrast is excellent, it almost makes the boys pop off the comupter screen.  The colored belts add interest.  I bet they had fun modeling for you.  The expression is perfect.</td>', 'The sharp contrast is excellent, it almost makes the boys pop off the comupter screen.  The colored belts add interest.  I bet they had fun modeling for you.  The expression is perfect.', '2004-09-24 16:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(924967, 105534, 25140, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, it almost looks like a painting.</td>', 'Beautiful, it almost looks like a painting.', '2004-09-24 16:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(924968, 105316, 25140, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the water drops.  It''s the colors that make it stand out.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the water drops.  It''s the colors that make it stand out.', '2004-09-24 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(924974, 105644, 25140, '<td valign="top">You have really frozen time in this picture.  The light behind the water drops really enhances the photo, it follows the bend of the faucet making for a really nice composition and it makes the drops stand out, almost as if I could touch them.</td>', 'You have really frozen time in this picture.  The light behind the water drops really enhances the photo, it follows the bend of the faucet making for a really nice composition and it makes the drops stand out, almost as if I could touch them.', '2004-09-24 16:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(924976, 105975, 25140, '<td valign="top">I love the angle you shot this at.  The colors are great.  I hope that others have not accused you of faking this (like they have mine), because I''m sure this took a lot of time to set up and capture. Great shot -10</td>', 'I love the angle you shot this at.  The colors are great.  I hope that others have not accused you of faking this (like they have mine), because I''m sure this took a lot of time to set up and capture. Great shot -10', '2004-09-24 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(924978, 106055, 25140, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great shot and a great idea.  It''s just a little dark (I didn''t see the hammer at first glance) but I don''t really care because the exploding glass is really cool.</td>', 'Wow, this is a great shot and a great idea.  It''s just a little dark (I didn''t see the hammer at first glance) but I don''t really care because the exploding glass is really cool.', '2004-09-24 16:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(924981, 106051, 18191, '<td valign="top">The green in the top left is distracting. A vertical crop would have fixed this.</td>', 'The green in the top left is distracting. A vertical crop would have fixed this.', '2004-09-24 16:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(924982, 106341, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2004-09-24 16:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(924983, 106164, 25140, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this shot - the cobblestones, shadow, expressions; the contrast and tone.  And it''s original.</td>', 'I love everything about this shot - the cobblestones, shadow, expressions; the contrast and tone.  And it''s original.', '2004-09-24 16:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(924985, 105855, 25140, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, perhaps it could be a little lighter.  Still an excellent shot.</td>', 'Nice depth of field, perhaps it could be a little lighter.  Still an excellent shot.', '2004-09-24 16:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(924994, 105936, 25140, '<td valign="top">You''ve proven that spilt milk can be beautiful.   I may have to get a print of this shot and hang it over my kitchen table to remind me of that (we spill a glass at least 2-3 times a week).  I would like to see it in a different setting, but the milk drops are really what stands out.</td>', 'You''ve proven that spilt milk can be beautiful.   I may have to get a print of this shot and hang it over my kitchen table to remind me of that (we spill a glass at least 2-3 times a week).  I would like to see it in a different setting, but the milk drops are really what stands out.', '2004-09-24 16:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(925260, 106367, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very cute and meets the challenge. A bit of a "snapshot" feel to it, however.</td>', 'Very cute and meets the challenge. A bit of a "snapshot" feel to it, however.', '2004-09-24 20:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(925261, 106349, 11793, '<td valign="top">all of the faces are over exposed.  i may have under exposed slightly, and then brought the ball more to white on the computer.</td>', 'all of the faces are over exposed.  i may have under exposed slightly, and then brought the ball more to white on the computer.', '2004-09-24 20:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(925263, 105646, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great catch of the moment!  Good composition too, though I might have cropped out the right side to just left of the pole.</td>', 'Great catch of the moment!  Good composition too, though I might have cropped out the right side to just left of the pole.', '2004-09-24 20:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(925265, 105171, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot both towards the dart and towards the dartboard.  Well done photo.</td>', 'Good shot both towards the dart and towards the dartboard.  Well done photo.', '2004-09-24 20:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(925267, 106136, 20779, '<td valign="top">Perfect detail cuaght and great lighting. The overall composition is not a "wow" for me, but very well done!</td>', 'Perfect detail cuaght and great lighting. The overall composition is not a "wow" for me, but very well done!', '2004-09-24 20:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(925273, 106230, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The water looks like it is coming straight out at me.</td>', 'Great shot. The water looks like it is coming straight out at me.', '2004-09-24 20:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(925299, 106259, 11793, '<td valign="top">looks to be a bit over sharpened.<br/></td>', 'looks to be a bit over sharpened.', '2004-09-24 20:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(925306, 106122, 11793, '<td valign="top">nice shot.<br/></td>', 'nice shot.', '2004-09-24 20:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(925328, 105971, 17045, '<td valign="top">ohh! very nice!!</td>', 'ohh! very nice!!', '2004-09-24 20:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(925420, 105653, 25946, '<td valign="top">This is my very favorite.  Very original and I just love it!!!</td>', 'This is my very favorite.  Very original and I just love it!!!', '2004-09-24 23:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(925444, 106309, 7969, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! It is by far the best shot in the challenge, I hope it wins blue.  It is exotic, funny, captures action, tells a story.  Makes me want to be there.  I do hope you will tell what was happening after the challenge.   My only slight technical critique is that I wish was cropped tighter on the right to match the left.  But no matter-- 10</td>', 'I love this shot! It is by far the best shot in the challenge, I hope it wins blue.  It is exotic, funny, captures action, tells a story.  Makes me want to be there.  I do hope you will tell what was happening after the challenge.   My only slight technical critique is that I wish was cropped tighter on the right to match the left.  But no matter-- 10', '2004-09-24 23:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(925452, 105675, 25150, '<td valign="top">wow,<br/>great shot.<br/>how???<br/>did you use strobes?</td>', 'wow,great shot.how???did you use strobes?', '2004-09-24 23:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(925454, 106055, 25150, '<td valign="top">excellent shot, hope this was the first try and not the 10th!</td>', 'excellent shot, hope this was the first try and not the 10th!', '2004-09-24 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(925457, 105653, 25150, '<td valign="top">good shot, great composition, top 3 for sure! Hope you tell us how you did it!</td>', 'good shot, great composition, top 3 for sure! Hope you tell us how you did it!', '2004-09-24 23:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(925458, 106347, 25150, '<td valign="top">this is so perfect, I don''t know what to say! I cant see how this won''t place top 3 if not #1<br/>Great job, tell us how it was done!</td>', 'this is so perfect, I don''t know what to say! I cant see how this won''t place top 3 if not #1Great job, tell us how it was done!', '2004-09-24 23:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(925459, 106355, 25150, '<td valign="top">I just love this.<br/>the composition is perfect, the looks are terrific, great shot!</td>', 'I just love this.the composition is perfect, the looks are terrific, great shot!', '2004-09-24 23:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(925461, 106050, 25150, '<td valign="top">I''m really confused about this image. There is a reflection in the black, so it''s obviousely not the sky, so I thought it''s upside down but the fence and trees would be wrong. And what''s that in the top left corner?<br/> <br/>Wait, did you burn in the background to make it really dark? I think I see it now. <br/> <br/>Anyways, good shot and very creative use of darkening, it''s almost space-like<br/> <br/>E</td>', 'I''m really confused about this image. There is a reflection in the black, so it''s obviousely not the sky, so I thought it''s upside down but the fence and trees would be wrong. And what''s that in the top left corner? Wait, did you burn in the background to make it really dark? I think I see it now.  Anyways, good shot and very creative use of darkening, it''s almost space-like E', '2004-09-24 23:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(925463, 106208, 25150, '<td valign="top">glad it worked on the first shot huh? she looks dry, or did she change several times! anyways, good stop!</td>', 'glad it worked on the first shot huh? she looks dry, or did she change several times! anyways, good stop!', '2004-09-24 23:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(925465, 105762, 25150, '<td valign="top">water water everywhere...<br/> <br/>But a different take and a good shot! Don''t care for the tile lines in the background<br/> <br/>Great title too (would have maybe worked better with a darker liquid, like scotch)</td>', 'water water everywhere... But a different take and a good shot! Don''t care for the tile lines in the background Great title too (would have maybe worked better with a darker liquid, like scotch)', '2004-09-24 23:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(925466, 106328, 25150, '<td valign="top">The best bird shot in the challenge IMO<br/>Good shot, great colors, perfect composition</td>', 'The best bird shot in the challenge IMOGood shot, great colors, perfect composition', '2004-09-24 23:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(925470, 105653, 26930, '<td valign="top">The intelectual + the violent touch... something new and inspiring<br/> <br/>Very nice.. 9 from me</td>', 'The intelectual + the violent touch... something new and inspiring Very nice.. 9 from me', '2004-09-24 23:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(925471, 106239, 21367, '<td valign="top">I might have used different lighting in this situation or tried to use the shadows to my advantage by capturing the stop motion of the dropping liquid in the shadow (you almost got it) as well as what you have captured with the subject.  It is an interesting shot none the less.</td>', 'I might have used different lighting in this situation or tried to use the shadows to my advantage by capturing the stop motion of the dropping liquid in the shadow (you almost got it) as well as what you have captured with the subject.  It is an interesting shot none the less.', '2004-09-25 00:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(925476, 105653, 21367, '<td valign="top">This has got to be my favorite in the challenge.  Great idea excellent execution.  This would be a great stock photo.  Almost too perfect as absolutly nothing is moving in the shot, black background, two pieces still on the board... I still like it.</td>', 'This has got to be my favorite in the challenge.  Great idea excellent execution.  This would be a great stock photo.  Almost too perfect as absolutly nothing is moving in the shot, black background, two pieces still on the board... I still like it.', '2004-09-25 00:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(925492, 106055, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well thats taking the broken lightbulb from the smoke challenge a step further... very cool indeed.</td>', 'Well thats taking the broken lightbulb from the smoke challenge a step further... very cool indeed.', '2004-09-25 00:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(925495, 106183, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Real juggling or not this is a great photo.  Bright primary colors, sharp clear focus and great shadows.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Wow.  Real juggling or not this is a great photo.  Bright primary colors, sharp clear focus and great shadows.  One of my favorites.', '2004-09-25 00:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(925499, 105791, 19936, '<td valign="top">I know everyone is tired of these shots.  But I love it!  Great clarity and the cream looks like cream!  Looks like maybe more than one take as I can see red pixels from the strawberry in the cream.  But it just adds to the realism for me.  Good job and a 10 from me.</td>', 'I know everyone is tired of these shots.  But I love it!  Great clarity and the cream looks like cream!  Looks like maybe more than one take as I can see red pixels from the strawberry in the cream.  But it just adds to the realism for me.  Good job and a 10 from me.', '2004-09-25 00:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(925501, 106053, 19936, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  Colorful, sharp, clear and on topic.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Good capture.  Colorful, sharp, clear and on topic.  One of my favorites.', '2004-09-25 00:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(925503, 105653, 19936, '<td valign="top">Temper temper.  Nice shot that captures the topic of the challenge well.  Looks like it was staged but great either way.  Very clean.</td>', 'Temper temper.  Nice shot that captures the topic of the challenge well.  Looks like it was staged but great either way.  Very clean.', '2004-09-25 00:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(925505, 105646, 19936, '<td valign="top">Good shot although I think it could have benefited from a closer crop of the wave, man and wall.  Still great timing!</td>', 'Good shot although I think it could have benefited from a closer crop of the wave, man and wall.  Still great timing!', '2004-09-25 00:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(925508, 106307, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this had the potential to be an excellent shot, but the angle makes it very difficult to make out the birds features.  That makes it difficult instead of pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'I think this had the potential to be an excellent shot, but the angle makes it very difficult to make out the birds features.  That makes it difficult instead of pleasing to the eye.', '2004-09-25 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(925509, 106192, 19936, '<td valign="top">Good stop action but lacks the clarity and brightness a shot like this needs.  Maybe a different angle from the sun?  Take a look at the other single juggler shot in this contest and you will see what I mean.</td>', 'Good stop action but lacks the clarity and brightness a shot like this needs.  Maybe a different angle from the sun?  Take a look at the other single juggler shot in this contest and you will see what I mean.', '2004-09-25 00:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(925512, 106004, 19936, '<td valign="top">Like the colors and you definitely stopped the action.  Background is a little distracting though.</td>', 'Like the colors and you definitely stopped the action.  Background is a little distracting though.', '2004-09-25 00:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(925514, 106321, 19936, '<td valign="top">Come on.  No fair using a cute little girl to gain points.  This is a keeper!  Cropped perfect and works well in sepia Good job.</td>', 'Come on.  No fair using a cute little girl to gain points.  This is a keeper!  Cropped perfect and works well in sepia Good job.', '2004-09-25 00:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(925515, 105603, 25464, '<td valign="top">Good stop of motion, but serious composition problems.  I would recommend trying to capture this shot without the tree tops in the background.  I would also recommend taking this as landscape instead of portrait.  The lighting is also a bit harsh, but could work for this picture with the other corrections.</td>', 'Good stop of motion, but serious composition problems.  I would recommend trying to capture this shot without the tree tops in the background.  I would also recommend taking this as landscape instead of portrait.  The lighting is also a bit harsh, but could work for this picture with the other corrections.', '2004-09-25 00:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(925516, 105971, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully colored photo, but not a very challenging subject for a stopped motion challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautifully colored photo, but not a very challenging subject for a stopped motion challenge.', '2004-09-25 00:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(925517, 106290, 19936, '<td valign="top">Color, clarity and action - stopped - what more can we ask.  Good job.</td>', 'Color, clarity and action - stopped - what more can we ask.  Good job.', '2004-09-25 00:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(925518, 106321, 25464, '<td valign="top">A second earlier and the composition would have been much better.  I dont really like the use of black and white here.  I don''t think it adds anything to the shot.  Motion blur is present.  Cutie pie.</td>', 'A second earlier and the composition would have been much better.  I dont really like the use of black and white here.  I don''t think it adds anything to the shot.  Motion blur is present.  Cutie pie.', '2004-09-25 00:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(925519, 106181, 19936, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Not sure what is going on here?  Easter and forgot to hardboil? Clear and colorful but ..... I just can''t put my finger onwhat is wrong.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Not sure what is going on here?  Easter and forgot to hardboil? Clear and colorful but ..... I just can''t put my finger onwhat is wrong.', '2004-09-25 01:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(925520, 106253, 25464, '<td valign="top">I have a boxer that looks a lot like this guy. Aren''t they great?  Good stopped motion (I know how fast the move) but the composition is just not very pleasing.</td>', 'I have a boxer that looks a lot like this guy. Aren''t they great?  Good stopped motion (I know how fast the move) but the composition is just not very pleasing.', '2004-09-25 01:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(925521, 106331, 25464, '<td valign="top">The composition is just a bit strange for me, and a bit of motion blur is evident.  Nice color and the water looks great.</td>', 'The composition is just a bit strange for me, and a bit of motion blur is evident.  Nice color and the water looks great.', '2004-09-25 01:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(925524, 106002, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture!  I''m anticipating the eruption!  A little soft and out of focus though.  With Advanced rules maybe you could have cloned out the ropes in the background?</td>', 'Wow, great capture!  I''m anticipating the eruption!  A little soft and out of focus though.  With Advanced rules maybe you could have cloned out the ropes in the background?', '2004-09-25 01:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(925527, 106322, 25464, '<td valign="top">Good stopped motion. Captured expression nicely.  The background is a bit distracting, but very nice photo.</td>', 'Good stopped motion. Captured expression nicely.  The background is a bit distracting, but very nice photo.', '2004-09-25 01:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(925532, 106252, 19936, '<td valign="top">Pretty good photo for indoor.  With high ISO (I''m guessing) I would have expected less color and more grain.  Good job.</td>', 'Pretty good photo for indoor.  With high ISO (I''m guessing) I would have expected less color and more grain.  Good job.', '2004-09-25 01:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(925540, 106230, 19936, '<td valign="top">Although this is a good capture IMHO it suffers from to much USM.  I''m sure it was a tough shot.</td>', 'Although this is a good capture IMHO it suffers from to much USM.  I''m sure it was a tough shot.', '2004-09-25 01:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(925544, 106098, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  I don''t think I could have gotten it that clear without cheating, but wheres the fun in that.  Nice color choices.  Very good job.</td>', 'Great focus.  I don''t think I could have gotten it that clear without cheating, but wheres the fun in that.  Nice color choices.  Very good job.', '2004-09-25 01:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(925545, 106327, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to the water thing.  Great color.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting approach to the water thing.  Great color.  Good job.', '2004-09-25 01:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(925548, 106353, 19936, '<td valign="top">These are hard to capture.  As you can see there are a few water drop shots in this contest.  To have one stand out it has to be tack sharp and have some gimic to it.  See the strawberry and cream shot to see what I mean.  Good luck.</td>', 'These are hard to capture.  As you can see there are a few water drop shots in this contest.  To have one stand out it has to be tack sharp and have some gimic to it.  See the strawberry and cream shot to see what I mean.  Good luck.', '2004-09-25 01:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(925556, 106050, 19936, '<td valign="top">I missing something here.  Why the balck on top and white on bottom background?  Seems the whole bottom of this photo could have been cropped out.  Would have made it a better picture for me at least.</td>', 'I missing something here.  Why the balck on top and white on bottom background?  Seems the whole bottom of this photo could have been cropped out.  Would have made it a better picture for me at least.', '2004-09-25 01:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(925558, 106123, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the execution did not come out well.  For me better focus on the feather (and a larger feather) would have made it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great idea but the execution did not come out well.  For me better focus on the feather (and a larger feather) would have made it.  Good luck.', '2004-09-25 01:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(925561, 106263, 19936, '<td valign="top">Hey, I know how hard it is to catch up with these guys.  I tried for this challenge also.  Good shot that could have been better had he been facing you or maybe taking off.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hey, I know how hard it is to catch up with these guys.  I tried for this challenge also.  Good shot that could have been better had he been facing you or maybe taking off.  Good luck.', '2004-09-25 01:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(925593, 106172, 18450, '<td valign="top">Really like this!! Excellent shot and use of selective saturation........creative idea and great compostion</td>', 'Really like this!! Excellent shot and use of selective saturation........creative idea and great compostion', '2004-09-25 02:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(925643, 105971, 20056, '<td valign="top">Great colors! and the sky is not boring</td>', 'Great colors! and the sky is not boring', '2004-09-25 03:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(925646, 106187, 20056, '<td valign="top">Impresive!, nikon?</td>', 'Impresive!, nikon?', '2004-09-25 04:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(925650, 106293, 20056, '<td valign="top">If I would give points: 10<br/>Maybe even better if a little more shap</td>', 'If I would give points: 10Maybe even better if a little more shap', '2004-09-25 04:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(925686, 106126, 27262, '<td valign="top">i like the colors , but i wounder how it would have looked in a verticle format.</td>', 'i like the colors , but i wounder how it would have looked in a verticle format.', '2004-09-25 06:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(925701, 105534, 12131, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The graceful line of the wings and the colors are wonderful.  I think the border makes a nice touch.  8</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The graceful line of the wings and the colors are wonderful.  I think the border makes a nice touch.  8', '2004-09-25 08:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(925703, 105171, 12131, '<td valign="top">I wish!  Nice shot.</td>', 'I wish!  Nice shot.', '2004-09-25 08:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(925704, 106224, 12131, '<td valign="top">You know, it could almost look like he''s trying to hit the ball toward the umpire.  Nice catch (no pun intended).</td>', 'You know, it could almost look like he''s trying to hit the ball toward the umpire.  Nice catch (no pun intended).', '2004-09-25 08:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(925705, 106004, 12131, '<td valign="top">The thumb and one arm on the right seem to have a bit of motion blur but other than that, very well done.  I love seeing the clear parallel of the two middle clubs.</td>', 'The thumb and one arm on the right seem to have a bit of motion blur but other than that, very well done.  I love seeing the clear parallel of the two middle clubs.', '2004-09-25 08:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(925706, 106125, 12131, '<td valign="top">For a minute there I thought those were full size.  Good shot. 8</td>', 'For a minute there I thought those were full size.  Good shot. 8', '2004-09-25 08:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(925707, 106332, 12131, '<td valign="top">That''s almost eerie, I don''t know why.  Still, it''s very cool.  What kind of jets are these?</td>', 'That''s almost eerie, I don''t know why.  Still, it''s very cool.  What kind of jets are these?', '2004-09-25 08:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(925708, 106096, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the content and the clarity.  If there''s anything, I get a little distracted by the negative space at the bottom.  Maybe shorten the image up a bit?  8</td>', 'I like the content and the clarity.  If there''s anything, I get a little distracted by the negative space at the bottom.  Maybe shorten the image up a bit?  8', '2004-09-25 08:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
