(926105, 106343, 23251, '<td valign="top">Not sure what your options were, but having the action cropped at the top dosen''t seem to work for me.  If it were possible I would have had the action on the bottom 1/3rd of the photo.</td>', 'Not sure what your options were, but having the action cropped at the top dosen''t seem to work for me.  If it were possible I would have had the action on the bottom 1/3rd of the photo.', '2004-09-25 18:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
