(926215, 106111, 26472, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this shot. Focus is crisp and I love the composition. Excellent, excellent work.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this shot. Focus is crisp and I love the composition. Excellent, excellent work.', '2004-09-25 23:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(926216, 106148, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting capture, but not a very asthetically pleasing photo.  Maybe a close up of just the balloon?</td>', 'This is an interesting capture, but not a very asthetically pleasing photo.  Maybe a close up of just the balloon?', '2004-09-25 23:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(926220, 105814, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo.  I think the background is too dark which takes attention from the subject, and the focus is too soft for this challenge; however, I do like it.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo.  I think the background is too dark which takes attention from the subject, and the focus is too soft for this challenge; however, I do like it.', '2004-09-25 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(926221, 106097, 26472, '<td valign="top">I especially like how you were able to capture two different colors of leaves. It looks like the ones that are falling are red or brown, and the green leaves on the tree give a nice contrast.</td>', 'I especially like how you were able to capture two different colors of leaves. It looks like the ones that are falling are red or brown, and the green leaves on the tree give a nice contrast.', '2004-09-25 23:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(926222, 105730, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is excellent stopped motion and great focus, but just not a very interesting composition in my opinion.</td>', 'This is excellent stopped motion and great focus, but just not a very interesting composition in my opinion.', '2004-09-25 23:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(926225, 106002, 26472, '<td valign="top">Amazing stop action photography here. Too bad you weren''t able to eliminate the ropes in the background, but you caught it at the right time.</td>', 'Amazing stop action photography here. Too bad you weren''t able to eliminate the ropes in the background, but you caught it at the right time.', '2004-09-25 23:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(926229, 106182, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very hard to do, but very overdone.  I think the edge of the surface showing in the background is a bit distracting, but good job catching the motion.  I tried to do this just to see if I could and failed miserably.</td>', 'Very hard to do, but very overdone.  I think the edge of the surface showing in the background is a bit distracting, but good job catching the motion.  I tried to do this just to see if I could and failed miserably.', '2004-09-25 23:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(926231, 106164, 26472, '<td valign="top">Sharp, wonderful focus. Wish you would have been able to capture where the rope intersects with the pole. Love the tonal range.</td>', 'Sharp, wonderful focus. Wish you would have been able to capture where the rope intersects with the pole. Love the tonal range.', '2004-09-25 23:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(926235, 106172, 26472, '<td valign="top">Love the blend of B&amp;W and color to highlight the green grass. Very attractive.</td>', 'Love the blend of B&W and color to highlight the green grass. Very attractive.', '2004-09-25 23:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(926237, 106172, 25464, '<td valign="top">Excellent unique idea.  I also like the selective desat.  I think the composition is lacking.  I would have liked to see the whole mower in the frame or at least an angle that would take the focus from the bar in the center of the photo and place it on the grass motion captured.</td>', 'Excellent unique idea.  I also like the selective desat.  I think the composition is lacking.  I would have liked to see the whole mower in the frame or at least an angle that would take the focus from the bar in the center of the photo and place it on the grass motion captured.', '2004-09-25 23:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(926241, 106150, 26472, '<td valign="top">I really like how the pattern is reflected in the drops, but the stripes mess with my eyes. Is this water or gel? There are some strange lines at the far right side of the ripples. Is that something solid or just a reflection?</td>', 'I really like how the pattern is reflected in the drops, but the stripes mess with my eyes. Is this water or gel? There are some strange lines at the far right side of the ripples. Is that something solid or just a reflection?', '2004-09-25 23:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(926247, 106126, 26472, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color. Background is slightly too dark for my taste in a shot like this, but your focus is bang-on. Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful color. Background is slightly too dark for my taste in a shot like this, but your focus is bang-on. Very nice.', '2004-09-25 23:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(926252, 106208, 26472, '<td valign="top">I love how you were able to capture the water right before it splashed up over her legs. I especially how you can see how the water has been displaced around her and hasn''t started to rush back in. Very nice.</td>', 'I love how you were able to capture the water right before it splashed up over her legs. I especially how you can see how the water has been displaced around her and hasn''t started to rush back in. Very nice.', '2004-09-25 23:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(926255, 106315, 24016, '<td valign="top">nice photograph. the cup itself seems to be a bit off balance but the water and the water drop in the cup are well captured. nice stopped motion.</td>', 'nice photograph. the cup itself seems to be a bit off balance but the water and the water drop in the cup are well captured. nice stopped motion.', '2004-09-25 23:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(926257, 105675, 26472, '<td valign="top">Holy cow! That is cool! I''m guessing that the bit to the far right is the bullet. What I love the most, however, is how you can see how the rubber is starting to wrinkle as the water falls out.</td>', 'Holy cow! That is cool! I''m guessing that the bit to the far right is the bullet. What I love the most, however, is how you can see how the rubber is starting to wrinkle as the water falls out.', '2004-09-25 23:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(926258, 106164, 24016, '<td valign="top">i really like this photograph. very atmospheric, stopped action indeed. also, i think it communicates the emotion of the girl and you can almost hear the boy laughing. well done!</td>', 'i really like this photograph. very atmospheric, stopped action indeed. also, i think it communicates the emotion of the girl and you can almost hear the boy laughing. well done!', '2004-09-25 23:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(926260, 106002, 24016, '<td valign="top">unreal capture! how did you manage to get so close and so clear on the action? wonderful shot!</td>', 'unreal capture! how did you manage to get so close and so clear on the action? wonderful shot!', '2004-09-25 23:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(926264, 105814, 24016, '<td valign="top">the very slight blur on the wings does not take away from the image and from the stopped action of flight and from the wonderful shot overall. love the background too!</td>', 'the very slight blur on the wings does not take away from the image and from the stopped action of flight and from the wonderful shot overall. love the background too!', '2004-09-25 23:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(926267, 106355, 26472, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. In focus, well lit, wonderful expression. Love that purple belt flying in the air and how you captured that vein on the boy''s (purple) lower arm.  The tension in the fingers is gorgeous.</td>', 'Beautifully done. In focus, well lit, wonderful expression. Love that purple belt flying in the air and how you captured that vein on the boy''s (purple) lower arm.  The tension in the fingers is gorgeous.', '2004-09-25 23:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(926268, 106253, 24016, '<td valign="top">i tried to do the same thing with my dog, so i can appreciate the difficulty in capturing the "stopped motion" in this. the dog''s  eyes and his mouth are so wide opened, it really reflects well the thrill of playing the ball. well done.</td>', 'i tried to do the same thing with my dog, so i can appreciate the difficulty in capturing the "stopped motion" in this. the dog''s  eyes and his mouth are so wide opened, it really reflects well the thrill of playing the ball. well done.', '2004-09-25 23:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(926272, 105791, 26472, '<td valign="top">I just can''t figure it out. How did you get the strawberry to bounce? It doesn''t seem like it''s a shallow dish, but I guess it must be.</td>', 'I just can''t figure it out. How did you get the strawberry to bounce? It doesn''t seem like it''s a shallow dish, but I guess it must be.', '2004-09-25 23:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(926275, 105936, 26472, '<td valign="top">Love that 3-drop combination at the top of the image.</td>', 'Love that 3-drop combination at the top of the image.', '2004-09-26 00:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(926276, 106341, 26472, '<td valign="top">Love the foam</td>', 'Love the foam', '2004-09-26 00:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(926277, 105646, 26472, '<td valign="top">It just wouldn''t be as good without the person running away from the wave. Wonderful capture.</td>', 'It just wouldn''t be as good without the person running away from the wave. Wonderful capture.', '2004-09-26 00:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(926279, 106055, 26472, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed. The lighting is wonderful.</td>', 'Beautifully executed. The lighting is wonderful.', '2004-09-26 00:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(926282, 106366, 26472, '<td valign="top">I love the concept, but I''m not a fan of the solarization. I would like to see the original and compare the two. Thank you for trying something different. I think this is one of the riskyist shots in the group.</td>', 'I love the concept, but I''m not a fan of the solarization. I would like to see the original and compare the two. Thank you for trying something different. I think this is one of the riskyist shots in the group.', '2004-09-26 00:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(926285, 106363, 26472, '<td valign="top">This would be an excellent shot for the company''s catalog. The only think I''m not crazy about is the large shadow that is being cast by the water droplet. Nicely done.</td>', 'This would be an excellent shot for the company''s catalog. The only think I''m not crazy about is the large shadow that is being cast by the water droplet. Nicely done.', '2004-09-26 00:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(926289, 105708, 26472, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but the angle of the shot makes it look like the arm is bending backward. Love the lighting. It''s hard to get the face properly exposed under a baseball cap. Good work.</td>', 'Very nice, but the angle of the shot makes it look like the arm is bending backward. Love the lighting. It''s hard to get the face properly exposed under a baseball cap. Good work.', '2004-09-26 00:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(926291, 105716, 26472, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Love the smoke exiting the chamber and the casing. I think I would have liked to have seen more of the hands, but its difficult to say.</td>', 'Nice capture. Love the smoke exiting the chamber and the casing. I think I would have liked to have seen more of the hands, but its difficult to say.', '2004-09-26 00:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(926298, 106233, 26472, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. It isn''t the typical shot of the flag on a mountain top or in some other picturesque setting. Nice shot showing urban America. The only thing I thought was strange was the small bit of red at the top right of the shot. What is that?</td>', 'I really like this image. It isn''t the typical shot of the flag on a mountain top or in some other picturesque setting. Nice shot showing urban America. The only thing I thought was strange was the small bit of red at the top right of the shot. What is that?', '2004-09-26 00:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(926300, 105855, 26472, '<td valign="top">Of all the bird shots, this is by far my favorite. I love the mossy green contrasting with the white feathers in the wings.</td>', 'Of all the bird shots, this is by far my favorite. I love the mossy green contrasting with the white feathers in the wings.', '2004-09-26 00:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(926303, 106181, 26472, '<td valign="top">Yep. This really makes me think of rotten eggs. Ewww.</td>', 'Yep. This really makes me think of rotten eggs. Ewww.', '2004-09-26 00:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(926305, 106123, 26472, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I love the simplicity.</td>', 'Pretty. I love the simplicity.', '2004-09-26 00:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(926308, 106348, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the latin name. I know Larus is seagull, but I don''t know what fuscus is. Beautiful shot. Seems a bit noisy. cool water</td>', 'I like the latin name. I know Larus is seagull, but I don''t know what fuscus is. Beautiful shot. Seems a bit noisy. cool water', '2004-09-26 00:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(926309, 106340, 26472, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you took this at a county fair. Love the originality.</td>', 'I''m guessing you took this at a county fair. Love the originality.', '2004-09-26 00:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(926310, 105730, 26472, '<td valign="top">Excellent timing. I kept looking for the other piece of the tee.</td>', 'Excellent timing. I kept looking for the other piece of the tee.', '2004-09-26 00:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(926311, 106348, 26472, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I''m glad you kept this as color to keep the steely-blue color of the water.</td>', 'Very pretty. I''m glad you kept this as color to keep the steely-blue color of the water.', '2004-09-26 00:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(926314, 106173, 26472, '<td valign="top">Focus is wonderful, but I''m not crazy about the red background. Love your cropping and the gap between the upper and lower halves.</td>', 'Focus is wonderful, but I''m not crazy about the red background. Love your cropping and the gap between the upper and lower halves.', '2004-09-26 00:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(926318, 106183, 26472, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and color</td>', 'Excellent composition and color', '2004-09-26 00:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(926325, 106293, 26472, '<td valign="top">Beautiful timing. Wings up, Wings down. I would like to see a minor adjustment however, to correct some of the darkness in the bird''s wings. I would like to have seen more feather detail.</td>', 'Beautiful timing. Wings up, Wings down. I would like to see a minor adjustment however, to correct some of the darkness in the bird''s wings. I would like to have seen more feather detail.', '2004-09-26 00:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(926326, 106253, 26472, '<td valign="top">Love the eyes on him!</td>', 'Love the eyes on him!', '2004-09-26 00:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(926331, 106239, 26472, '<td valign="top">The image has some ghosting on the edges which detracts from the shot, but your timing of the vodka falling into her mouth was excellent.</td>', 'The image has some ghosting on the edges which detracts from the shot, but your timing of the vodka falling into her mouth was excellent.', '2004-09-26 00:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(926333, 106367, 26472, '<td valign="top">Love the cropping. Does the little guy have red-eye from the flash, or does he actually have red eyes? Cute shot.</td>', 'Love the cropping. Does the little guy have red-eye from the flash, or does he actually have red eyes? Cute shot.', '2004-09-26 00:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(926337, 106320, 26472, '<td valign="top">Good color on this one. I love when photos capture sunlight filtering through skin, as you can see on the underside of his fingers.</td>', 'Good color on this one. I love when photos capture sunlight filtering through skin, as you can see on the underside of his fingers.', '2004-09-26 00:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(926342, 105797, 26472, '<td valign="top">Was this actually shot against a yellow background? The line of the glass looks very rough, which makes me wonder.</td>', 'Was this actually shot against a yellow background? The line of the glass looks very rough, which makes me wonder.', '2004-09-26 00:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(926348, 106098, 25773, '<td valign="top">This is advanced editing. With an all-black background you can just ''pick up'' a piece of paper from the floor and place it as if it was right above the basket. Otherwise pleasing.</td>', 'This is advanced editing. With an all-black background you can just ''pick up'' a piece of paper from the floor and place it as if it was right above the basket. Otherwise pleasing.', '2004-09-26 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(926353, 105971, 7560, '<td valign="top">It''s not typically what you think of as stopped motion unless you''ve seen a balloon race. :) The lighting here is excellent with a very well done gradient. The framing just makes the shot for me. 10</td>', 'It''s not typically what you think of as stopped motion unless you''ve seen a balloon race. :) The lighting here is excellent with a very well done gradient. The framing just makes the shot for me. 10', '2004-09-26 00:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(926364, 105791, 27289, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2004-09-26 01:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(926385, 106172, 27289, '<td valign="top">nice shot 6 for bravery.</td>', 'nice shot 6 for bravery.', '2004-09-26 01:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(926399, 105534, 7560, '<td valign="top">excellent capture. The sharpness it amazing. 10</td>', 'excellent capture. The sharpness it amazing. 10', '2004-09-26 02:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(926407, 106208, 3936, '<td valign="top">Excellent pic.  First try?  Or did she dry off between takes?  I like the capture of the moment of impact where the clothing doesn''t even show wetness yet.  10!</td>', 'Excellent pic.  First try?  Or did she dry off between takes?  I like the capture of the moment of impact where the clothing doesn''t even show wetness yet.  10!', '2004-09-26 02:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
