(926580, 106110, 8860, '<td valign="top">Smooth, clear, pretty shot. Motion is frozen too - but if anything this is neither quite abstract enough or defined enough - depending on whether you pull back or get closer. I''dd rather see this much closer and be left wondering what I''m looking at!</td>', 'Smooth, clear, pretty shot. Motion is frozen too - but if anything this is neither quite abstract enough or defined enough - depending on whether you pull back or get closer. I''dd rather see this much closer and be left wondering what I''m looking at!', '2004-09-26 12:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
