(926584, 105708, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice expression on the kid and all the elements are there that tell what''s happening.  The arm, however, is an odd element--its awkward angle is only accentuated by the too bright light and the lack of focus.  I think a greater depth of field would have helped...the picture makes me want to look at what he''s looking at, but when I get to the ball I''m forced back to his face.</td>', 'Nice expression on the kid and all the elements are there that tell what''s happening.  The arm, however, is an odd element--its awkward angle is only accentuated by the too bright light and the lack of focus.  I think a greater depth of field would have helped...the picture makes me want to look at what he''s looking at, but when I get to the ball I''m forced back to his face.', '2004-09-26 12:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(926588, 106359, 16488, '<td valign="top">The lack of contrast makes it difficult to see the subject of your photo--the yawn is only apparent after study.  Selective desaturation was an interesting choice for the subject, but did you accidentally desaturate the tiger''s tail?</td>', 'The lack of contrast makes it difficult to see the subject of your photo--the yawn is only apparent after study.  Selective desaturation was an interesting choice for the subject, but did you accidentally desaturate the tiger''s tail?', '2004-09-26 12:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(926600, 106148, 8860, '<td valign="top">This deserves top marks just for the image that it shows. I''ve always wanted to experiment with popping balloons and this makes me want to do it more. It''s an amazing capture so I suppose you breathed smoke into the balloon (which is what I wanted to try too).<br/> <br/>It does however suffer from very poor lighting - killer flash that has removed any artistic vibe in the shot - and dull subject matter (no offence to your female subject). Given the odd nature of the motion stoppage it doesn''t do it justice to depict it in a the form of a snapshot.</td>', 'This deserves top marks just for the image that it shows. I''ve always wanted to experiment with popping balloons and this makes me want to do it more. It''s an amazing capture so I suppose you breathed smoke into the balloon (which is what I wanted to try too). It does however suffer from very poor lighting - killer flash that has removed any artistic vibe in the shot - and dull subject matter (no offence to your female subject). Given the odd nature of the motion stoppage it doesn''t do it justice to depict it in a the form of a snapshot.', '2004-09-26 12:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(926602, 106183, 19978, '<td valign="top">Incredible image. I can''t wait to hear how you pulled it off. Beautiful composition and crop. Technically perfect.</td>', 'Incredible image. I can''t wait to hear how you pulled it off. Beautiful composition and crop. Technically perfect.', '2004-09-26 12:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
