(927215, 105988, 509, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, a little busy with the detailed drink containers on the left.  Also, I think a tablecloth, rather than a mirror, would prove a better table for the shot. (imho, the reflection is unnecessary)</td>', 'A nice idea, a little busy with the detailed drink containers on the left.  Also, I think a tablecloth, rather than a mirror, would prove a better table for the shot. (imho, the reflection is unnecessary)', '2004-09-27 00:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(927217, 106207, 25150, '<td valign="top">tap the rockies... I actually used to live about 2 miles from the base of the mountain on the right. It''s called mount Wilson, and it''s located in Telluride Colorado. The mountain range is called the San Juans, and I can''t stand that beer!<br/> <br/>Anyways, it''s a really nice shot. You really stopped the water perfectly. I think the whole effect might have been a little more stunning had the can been perfectly centered in the frame so you can see water exploding in every direction. Excellent shot overall, I''m sure you''ll do good!</td>', 'tap the rockies... I actually used to live about 2 miles from the base of the mountain on the right. It''s called mount Wilson, and it''s located in Telluride Colorado. The mountain range is called the San Juans, and I can''t stand that beer! Anyways, it''s a really nice shot. You really stopped the water perfectly. I think the whole effect might have been a little more stunning had the can been perfectly centered in the frame so you can see water exploding in every direction. Excellent shot overall, I''m sure you''ll do good!', '2004-09-27 00:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(927218, 105646, 509, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I love the candid nature of this.</td>', 'Great capture, I love the candid nature of this.', '2004-09-27 00:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(927220, 105681, 509, '<td valign="top">I like this - a very well done low-key shot.</td>', 'I like this - a very well done low-key shot.', '2004-09-27 00:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(927221, 106052, 25150, '<td valign="top">a really nice shot, but it almost seems as if the bottle is tipping in a little. That is easily fixed in photoshop though. Good idea, and nice capture!</td>', 'a really nice shot, but it almost seems as if the bottle is tipping in a little. That is easily fixed in photoshop though. Good idea, and nice capture!', '2004-09-27 00:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
