(927270, 106355, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hlswilson:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautifully done. In focus, well lit, wonderful expression. Love that purple belt flying in the air ...</i></td></tr></table> <br/>I like photos that have that one bit of a bright different color. I did guess right away that you''d used a trampoline, maybe because I''m pretty familiar with them since we had one at my elementary school. Good idea, well-done!</td>', 'Originally posted by hlswilson: Beautifully done. In focus, well lit, wonderful expression. Love that purple belt flying in the air ... I like photos that have that one bit of a bright different color. I did guess right away that you''d used a trampoline, maybe because I''m pretty familiar with them since we had one at my elementary school. Good idea, well-done!', '2004-09-27 01:23:38.000000', NULL, 0),
