(927579, 105534, 10413, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments on this.  I am thrilled it did so well. I was out back to shoot something else and had my inexpensive 50mm fixed lens on when I saw several ducks taking off. I just cropped this one out close. I wish I would have had my zoom len on. I was however lucky in the fact that this one was the only one that had totally turned to his winter color and I focused on him.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments on this.  I am thrilled it did so well. I was out back to shoot something else and had my inexpensive 50mm fixed lens on when I saw several ducks taking off. I just cropped this one out close. I wish I would have had my zoom len on. I was however lucky in the fact that this one was the only one that had totally turned to his winter color and I focused on him.', '2004-09-27 07:49:35.000000', NULL, 0),
