(928136, 106355, 4564, '<td valign="top">To Article19: fill lights were used during the actual taking of the shot, not during post process.  Using a trampoline is actuqally brilliant.  Cloning and blurring is basic usage of Photoshop.  We live in the digital era.  Get used to the digital darkroom.  Or else, grab a 35mm camera and use a classical darkroom.  - edit: BEAUTIFUL SHOT! Congrats!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-27 15:26:10.</i></td>', 'To Article19: fill lights were used during the actual taking of the shot, not during post process.  Using a trampoline is actuqally brilliant.  Cloning and blurring is basic usage of Photoshop.  We live in the digital era.  Get used to the digital darkroom.  Or else, grab a 35mm camera and use a classical darkroom.  - edit: BEAUTIFUL SHOT! Congrats!', '2004-09-27 16:25:45.000000', '2004-09-27 16:26:10.000000', 0),
