(930853, 106366, 23956, '<td valign="top">This shot was done with bright light between the hand and the background to get that outlining effect around the hand. Then I changed it to greyscale by using the channel mixer, and finally did two strong unsharp masks on it. <br/> <br/>The idea was for it to come out looking like a cheap photocopied ''rage'' poster of the sort you might see on a street corner, this one showing frustration with the expense of eating low-carb. Spaghetti, pictured here, is one of the cheapest foods there is, and it''s very much inaccessible to the low-carbohydrate dieter.<br/></td>', 'This shot was done with bright light between the hand and the background to get that outlining effect around the hand. Then I changed it to greyscale by using the channel mixer, and finally did two strong unsharp masks on it.  The idea was for it to come out looking like a cheap photocopied ''rage'' poster of the sort you might see on a street corner, this one showing frustration with the expense of eating low-carb. Spaghetti, pictured here, is one of the cheapest foods there is, and it''s very much inaccessible to the low-carbohydrate dieter.', '2004-09-29 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
