(986598, 106053, 18859, '<td valign="top">I purchased by cannon powershot pro1 about 6 months ago. I am still learning how to use all the features. I am impresses with the photo you have posted with the teleconverter lens attached to the camera. I am very interested in seeing some of the photos taken with the converter lens attached. The above listed photo is quite nice. I to0 see a small amount of halo around the subject. Great shot other wise. Love the subject.</td>', 'I purchased by cannon powershot pro1 about 6 months ago. I am still learning how to use all the features. I am impresses with the photo you have posted with the teleconverter lens attached to the camera. I am very interested in seeing some of the photos taken with the converter lens attached. The above listed photo is quite nice. I to0 see a small amount of halo around the subject. Great shot other wise. Love the subject.', '2004-11-02 17:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
