(1081665, 106293, 10658, '<td valign="top">Well if these are the kinds of shots I''ll be able to hope for with a Rebel then I''m going to have to go back to work so I can afford one :)  This was, of course, the first shot that caught my eye when I began looking at your portfolio.  This really should''ve placed higher...</td>', 'Well if these are the kinds of shots I''ll be able to hope for with a Rebel then I''m going to have to go back to work so I can afford one :)  This was, of course, the first shot that caught my eye when I began looking at your portfolio.  This really should''ve placed higher...', '2004-12-29 14:03:37.000000', NULL, 0),
