(3973796, 106183, 82320, '<td valign="top">Hiya Coley - great shot. I''m a graphic designer and I work for local government in the UK and we''d like to use the picture. We''ll be sending you an email with more details shortly on COLEY1@ROGERS.COM.<br/> <br/>Stuart Raith<br/>graphic designer<br/>Pendle Borough Council<br/>Nelson<br/>Lancashire<br/>BB9 7LG</td>', 'Hiya Coley - great shot. I''m a graphic designer and I work for local government in the UK and we''d like to use the picture. We''ll be sending you an email with more details shortly on COLEY1@ROGERS.COM. Stuart Raithgraphic designerPendle Borough CouncilNelsonLancashireBB9 7LG', '2007-08-06 11:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
