(4299257, 105814, 63269, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot... not sure why. I love the subdued colors, for one thing. And something about just the <i>shape </i>of the bird intrigues me. :) Beautiful image!</td>', 'I really like this shot... not sure why. I love the subdued colors, for one thing. And something about just the shape of the bird intrigues me. :) Beautiful image!', '2007-12-07 15:17:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4892284, 106017, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is really something to look and wonder at for quite awhile. It seems to show that he is using every feather in fine tuning his approach - look on ye aeronautics engineers and despair!  The asymmetry is a delight.</td>', 'This is really something to look and wonder at for quite awhile. It seems to show that he is using every feather in fine tuning his approach - look on ye aeronautics engineers and despair!  The asymmetry is a delight.', '2008-08-16 17:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
